Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:44.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucky ring on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.24,0:01:46.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel so much safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:48.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grip it. We're coming in hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:46.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:03.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:18.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:22.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing, we're on our way. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:42.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your dude's trippin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, forget this maniac!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not leavin' him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:54.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:41.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa. You just gonna roll up on me, huh? After eight damn years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:46.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were in a black-ops prison that doesn't officially exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just got the location from a guy named Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,an agency spook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:52.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Agency official. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:57.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you're in a time warp, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:01.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a waste of life. You make one damn mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:04.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wasn't a mistake. it was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:06.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you'd have done that to me, I would've chopped you into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You would've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you wanna thank the guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:14.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,The guys? Where are our guys? Hammer? Woodsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dead gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:19.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:25.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heard you killed more people than the plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:42.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,How 'bout that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do they call you Doctor Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:46.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Used to be a medic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:50.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,But that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:52.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,So Why'd you get locked away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:55.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tax evasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:01.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you all that's left of the Expendables?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:03.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:06.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,We started out with five. Built up to 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see Barney's still hanging the tags up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:17.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Said that jinglin' sound the tags make,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:19.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,that's a reminder that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:22.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,our brothers are still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:24.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:27.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,So come on, Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:31.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give an old-schooler your blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:36.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or else you might find your tags up there jinglin', too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:41.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jing-a-ling. Jing-a-ling, jing-a-ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:48.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sharpen it when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:06.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think your friend's a little off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:09.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Christmas. He's been in a hole for eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:10.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,How'd he get so lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:14.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,He tried pulling off this half-assed political assassination for a few bucks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,in this place called Swaziland. And he blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Self-destructive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you know what he is? He's a good medic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:24.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't need a checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:25.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you so sarcastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:26.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Vague?   - Secrets, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:33.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, why do you take me halfway around the planet to save this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:36.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,medical genius, as you describe him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:37.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:38.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's an Expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:41.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's an Expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:42.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, he's one of the flock?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:44.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:46.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you were incarcerated for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:48.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd come and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:54.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I know you'd do the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Truthfully?   - You'd let me rot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:57.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:02.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:07.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:08.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:12.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that real, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I spend three hours every morning
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,putting this on with a black Biro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:22.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is real. Authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Original. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:32.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Balance is a little off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:36.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You a knife man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:38.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Best. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the Knife Before Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.44,0:10:42.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Barney?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:43.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:47.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Probably free-stylin' with a blade while you were still suckin' on your daddy's titty,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:49.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,tryin' to learn how to eat with a spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:53.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Is that another little secret you was keeping there, Mr. Vague-o?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just stay out of my brain, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:57.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tell ya. I can't wait to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:01.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eat some good food, put on some fine threads,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:03.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,break out my '49 Pontiac,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:06.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,kick that baby until the engine blows up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:08.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You didn't tell him, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:12.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're not going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:15.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're stoppin' a dealer named Victor Minns delivering a shipment of thermobaric bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:17.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're stoppin' a dealer named Victor Minns delivering a shipment of thermobaric bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:18.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,That shit is hellfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:21.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, routine stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:23.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, why didn't you just pick me up on your way back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:25.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're a man short.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:27.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you know I'd love to party with you boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,but, uh, I don't have my shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:40.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's my shit.   - it is your shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:47.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doc, did you thank the guys for helping you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:11:59.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:04.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since I had a reason to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:07.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I just wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:11.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's getting his rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:13.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,l wanna say, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,His sincerity's overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:22.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think I'm gonna weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:23.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what? Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:27.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you not be sarcastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:29.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was great, Doc. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:30.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That was good.   - Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You haven't talked for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You got the gift.   - So you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like riding a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:36.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,To me it was like Churchill's best moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:38.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Gettysburg Address.   - I think I made my point...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:39.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it moved me. it moved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I moved you, too?   - Stunning delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:42.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Doc.   - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:47.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:52.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,No better place to be. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:28.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,'Bout time you boys showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Nice boat.   - Thanks, ladies. Stole it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:36.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got three more just like it patrolling the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:38.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two-man ground teams every 400 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just 'cause you can fly a plane don't make you smarter than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:42.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:47.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you the reason I've been stuck down here in this shithole?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:50.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shithole? Brother, you have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,This bitch'll solve all your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:01.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe for 10 seconds before it blows its wad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,So now you got that problem, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:07.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You walked into that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:10.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, look alive, look alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:24.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was all under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what it looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,He saw you, he didn't see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:33.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where ya been?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Had a doctor's appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:38.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Catch up with you boys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:41.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's he goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year, motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:46.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Makin' a housecall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:18.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doc, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sally, the man attacked me with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:02.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Damn. He's good.   - Maybe to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:10.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're gonna wanna see this.   - See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:11.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:46.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn. He's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:48.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Say it again, I'll shoot you.   - Chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:52.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:09.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:10.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,It'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:14.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney, it looks like the target is right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:17.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's Minns. Let's take him out fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney, I gotta put you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:40.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It can't be.   - What can't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:42.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gonna shoot these guys or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:43.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:45.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:47.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:51.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:56.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:07.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, get in, get in, get in, get in, get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:09.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney, move! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's time to mow the lawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:54.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Told you. Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:04.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on! I found you a ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:32.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:34.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:41.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How much we gettin' paid for this?   - Not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:57.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:30.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're not gonna fit!   - Always negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:45.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm getting carsick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.40,0:21:50.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.52,0:21:52.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Right side!   - Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:06.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.92,0:22:19.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Caesar, we're coming your way! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:34.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,In this filthy river. Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:38.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try to stay as close as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.48,0:22:45.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make room for Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:47.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move your asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:52.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,A huge black guy in a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold it, hold it! You got it goin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:17.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You all right?   - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:24.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:12.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.00,0:24:16.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.30,0:25:18.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will bring you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.92,0:27:23.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.04,0:27:25.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.16,0:27:26.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:29.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:32.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.36,0:27:33.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:36.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,He shot Caesar to get back at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.88,0:27:40.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm getting out of this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.88,0:27:42.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,And so should you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:45.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.88,0:27:49.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you need any help with Stonebanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.36,0:28:11.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to meet a guy named Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:12.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.08,0:28:14.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,So who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.12,0:28:16.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Operations Officer Drummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.56,0:28:19.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about Church anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.04,0:28:23.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's, um... He's out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.04,0:28:28.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus, Ross. What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.08,0:28:31.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gave you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.24,0:28:33.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Target, opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.36,0:28:35.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,all the intel you could ask for,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.88,0:28:38.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you got decimated
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.00,0:28:41.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,and my target walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:44.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am l wrong here? Am I missing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.76,0:28:48.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Church said the target's name was Victor Minns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:50.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And?   - He was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.12,0:28:53.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,His real name is Conrad Stonebanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.52,0:28:58.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,We knew him only as Victor Minns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:03.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Arms dealer, made billions selling to every psycho warlord
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.24,0:29:04.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,in Africa and the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.96,0:29:06.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Has his own mercenary army.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.80,0:29:08.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's personally responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.28,0:29:11.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,for torturing and killing
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.24,0:29:13.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,two of the best men
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.48,0:29:15.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I ever knew. Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:18.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit what his name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:19.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.48,0:29:22.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want him as bad as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.56,0:29:25.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,This happened on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.32,0:29:29.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You fucked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.32,0:29:31.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'm wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:36.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll find him. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.60,0:29:39.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got one more shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.04,0:29:43.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice to finally meet you, Barney.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.48,0:29:51.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your men are shot to shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.16,0:29:52.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do for a team?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.32,0:29:55.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. I'll handle it, Drummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.96,0:29:59.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.48,0:30:03.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna give yourself a stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.60,0:30:06.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's with these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.20,0:30:08.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.28,0:30:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you think when the artist painted this
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.20,0:30:46.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,he ever thought it would go for such a ridiculous price?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.88,0:30:49.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, what is it? It's just some paint,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.88,0:30:52.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,brushes, some cheap canvas. What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.20,0:30:59.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's shit. What do you want for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.80,0:31:02.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Three million.   - Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.40,0:31:05.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.40,0:31:14.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, it's very hard for me to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.68,0:31:17.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,but at one time, you guys were the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.36,0:31:20.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe still are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.56,0:31:23.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,But nothing lasts forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.76,0:31:30.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hard as it is to hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.52,0:31:35.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,we aren't the future anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.44,0:31:36.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.44,0:31:39.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,we're part of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.92,0:31:46.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, uh... You going somewhere with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.60,0:31:51.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,As I see it, if we keep this life up,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.44,0:31:57.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,the only way this thing ends, for all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.12,0:32:03.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,is in a hole in the ground and no one giving a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.64,0:32:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, if that's the way I'm supposed to go out, I can live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.44,0:32:13.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,For me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.28,0:32:17.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,But what I can't live with,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.96,0:32:20.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,and won't live with,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:25.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,is taking you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,What're you saying? That's our call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.32,0:32:30.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm changing things now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.84,0:32:35.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You. Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.44,0:32:38.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:44.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.12,0:32:46.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're done.   - Done?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:49.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You break me out to cut me loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.00,0:32:51.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:52.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You all will.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.20,0:32:57.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Live your lives while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.04,0:33:03.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where're you goin', Barney?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.20,0:33:17.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think you just pull the plug and that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.20,0:33:18.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:20.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, it doesn't work that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:22.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What?   - We've been through the mud,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.68,0:33:24.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,the shit, and the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.88,0:33:27.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I've saved your ass more times than I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.72,0:33:32.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,You owe me a shot at this son of a bitch that took Caesar down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.84,0:33:36.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.40,0:33:47.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,When I joined, I joined for the whole ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.92,0:33:50.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.56,0:33:54.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ride's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.32,0:35:16.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bonaparte.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.20,0:35:19.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry to hear about Caesar. Hope he pulls through.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.28,0:35:20.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's a good one. The good ones are rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.44,0:35:21.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.80,0:35:24.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, here we are again. What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.36,0:35:27.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,A new team. Retired the old ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.12,0:35:29.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the 21 st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.00,0:35:32.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,What kind of guys you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.16,0:35:35.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Young, hungry, willing to take a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:37.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going after Stonebanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.76,0:35:39.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.84,0:35:41.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glad to see I'm not the only one slipping a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:43.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks is dead, my friend. Mortuus diu.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.84,0:35:45.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.60,0:35:49.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.92,0:35:50.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,If he's half of what he used to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.04,0:35:52.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,four or five ain't gonna cut it. You're gonna need 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.12,0:35:54.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gotta move fast. No time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.52,0:35:55.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I gotta do it fast
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:35:56.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't guarantee the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.92,0:35:58.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just give me some that don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.28,0:36:00.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,What, it's a one-way ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:02.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.32,0:36:07.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine. I've got a line on a few head cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.12,0:36:10.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,A couple of these guys you'll probably end up shooting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.12,0:36:12.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. What about these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.84,0:36:13.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,They anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.88,0:36:15.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,These guys are pussies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.80,0:36:25.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goes by Thorn. Expert hacker. Drone pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.00,0:36:28.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did 18 months for hacking into Seattle's Central Operating System.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.08,0:36:30.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut down the whole city for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.84,0:36:32.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.32,0:36:33.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,'Cause he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.96,0:36:37.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.04,0:36:39.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking for an office worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.84,0:36:41.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.84,0:36:44.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.44,0:36:51.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another one with a death wish. You two got a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.96,0:36:56.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.40,0:37:06.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what? I'm gonna come right out and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.44,0:37:07.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I belong on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.00,0:37:11.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.24,0:37:20.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can't do that.   - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.52,0:37:23.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want a special rate on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.60,0:37:25.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, hazard pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.76,0:37:31.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Always on the damn road going someplace you don't give a damn about.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:33.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beats standing still.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.60,0:37:36.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've got two ex-wives and three kids who've lost my number would disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.48,0:37:43.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you turn off the auto-pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.96,0:37:45.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't touch the auto-pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:46.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.48,0:37:48.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are we off course?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:51.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are we? Here, hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.32,0:37:53.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.64,0:37:56.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that the Big Dipper? Yeah, we gotta turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.96,0:38:02.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next candidate is an expert at field craft and close-quarters combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.96,0:38:06.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Luna.   - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.08,0:38:08.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ambitious young lady. Meet a friend of mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:10.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney Ross. Barney Ross, Luna. Luna, Barney Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:12.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, how're you doin'?   - Pleasure to meet you, Mr. Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.48,0:38:14.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, follow me. I have your table waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.00,0:38:16.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.84,0:38:17.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, Luna, how are things?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.00,0:38:19.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know. Gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.24,0:38:22.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,What you wanna do? You wanna go, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.68,0:38:24.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you guys will excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.48,0:38:27.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, so what are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.12,0:38:29.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:31.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the candidate?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.72,0:38:34.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right there in the red dress, about to chop those guys in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.20,0:38:39.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,The hostess?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:42.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not the hostess. She's the bouncer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.12,0:39:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.40,0:39:05.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna slip on a dress and give it a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.88,0:39:11.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.84,0:39:16.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.40,0:39:17.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You ought to see her without heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.12,0:39:27.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,When was your last checkup?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:29.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. A while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.84,0:39:31.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,High cholesterol, plaque, all that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.56,0:39:32.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, pretty much.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:37.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Except with me they found a lump on my lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.80,0:39:40.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very dark, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.44,0:39:41.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.52,0:39:43.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I sure didn't see that comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.24,0:39:47.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.40,0:39:50.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try to make as much money as I can, fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.56,0:39:51.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.44,0:39:53.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,For those kids, you know. The ones I don't talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.64,0:39:55.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make some kind of good impression on 'em
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.56,0:39:56.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,when I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:39:59.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.88,0:40:01.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is sad. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.80,0:40:04.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ah, it's all bullshit. I'm fine.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.96,0:40:06.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just checking you're still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:13.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Had you going there, though, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.20,0:40:14.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, you did, God damn it.   - All right. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.96,0:40:16.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,That can never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.12,0:40:17.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll never trust you again.   - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.72,0:40:19.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next kid's a bit of a dark horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.40,0:40:21.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just came across my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.96,0:40:23.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't like throwing in wild cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.08,0:40:26.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,but this guy's creds were too good to pass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.40,0:40:28.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anybody seen Felipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.56,0:40:32.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, Felipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.80,0:40:42.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks good, Bonaparte.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.36,0:40:43.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.92,0:40:45.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You finally got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.64,0:40:52.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.72,0:41:00.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Felipe Silva, meet Barney Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.32,0:41:07.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Galgo. You sent me another fake resume?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.52,0:41:10.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eh, Mr. Ross, I can do what you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.36,0:41:11.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.52,0:41:13.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am healthier than I look, stronger than I look,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.68,0:41:14.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,faster than I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.76,0:41:15.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, faster than anybody I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.84,0:41:17.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit. You were born in 1984?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:18.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.84,0:41:20.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I feel like I was born in '84.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.84,0:41:22.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not waste your time. Barney, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.60,0:41:23.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.68,0:41:24.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ross, Mr. Ross! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.96,0:41:26.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.36,0:41:29.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,it's like I have discovered the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.92,0:41:33.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, not the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.60,0:41:35.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ponce de Leon discovered that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.96,0:41:39.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,By the way, another great Spaniard, like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.04,0:41:42.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No. Mr. Ross,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.56,0:41:45.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,age is just a state of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.44,0:41:50.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, you're only old when you surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.12,0:41:51.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,when you give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.32,0:41:53.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I haven't. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.16,0:41:54.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Galgo, this shit has got to stop.   - I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.68,0:41:56.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the third time this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.72,0:41:57.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seriously, move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.24,0:42:00.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this guy's story?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.24,0:42:02.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, I feel a little sorry for him. His last team dropped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.92,0:42:06.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back in the day, you couldn't catch him. Very fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.16,0:42:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Maybe even faster than you.   - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:12.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe. But what am I gonna say? It's a young man's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.80,0:42:15.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.08,0:42:19.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,All I know what to do is killing people!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.52,0:42:24.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I do that very well! God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.60,0:42:34.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the story on this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.76,0:42:36.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Found him at DARPA.   - DARPA?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.64,0:42:39.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it sounds like a town in North Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.48,0:42:41.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Defense Advanced Research Projects Agency,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.08,0:42:45.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,where they send the brightest military minds to develop next-gen weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.00,0:42:47.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Google it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.60,0:42:49.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking for a weapons nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.56,0:42:52.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you've come to the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.68,0:42:57.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yo, Marlito!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.76,0:43:07.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mars, I'd like you to meet Barney Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.60,0:43:09.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,As shooters go, Mars is as gifted as they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.00,0:43:11.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.92,0:43:12.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.00,0:43:16.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What I've got here is an XM25 assault rifle. Laser ranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.40,0:43:18.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,25mm high explosive airburst rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.60,0:43:21.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can be programmed to detonate over or behind a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.20,0:43:32.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.80,0:43:38.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Final candidate, John Smilee.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.12,0:43:40.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guy's got the most heat in the industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.40,0:43:44.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,A lot of skills, Marines, Special Operator. But there is an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.52,0:43:45.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,What issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:48.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,A classic authority problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.16,0:43:53.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a couple more swimming around in there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:26.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Barney, for wasting your time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.08,0:44:27.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's not the guy I thought he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.24,0:44:28.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:30.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.00,0:44:40.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,John. Meet Barney Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.92,0:44:45.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't do much to impress out there today, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.28,0:44:47.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You called me, I didn't call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.52,0:44:49.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Took a dive for the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:54.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you like getting your ass kicked in front of strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.24,0:45:05.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you guys want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.24,0:45:09.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You runnin' from somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.40,0:45:10.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.72,0:45:11.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.76,0:45:12.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, yeah?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.92,0:45:14.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.08,0:45:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe he thinks you've got potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.60,0:45:16.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're short on time. That about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.00,0:45:18.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.08,0:45:19.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that's your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.12,0:45:22.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,And your problem is you're rolling around in the dirt
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.60,0:45:24.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,for chump change.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:27.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hear you lost a few friends in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.68,0:45:30.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,They bought it. You didn't. You wear the guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.64,0:45:34.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been there. He's been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.08,0:45:36.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,We all lived it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.24,0:45:39.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.04,0:45:41.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.36,0:45:52.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bonaparte, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.00,0:45:55.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did waste my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.60,0:46:08.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You didn't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.60,0:46:28.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're going after Stonebanks, we might wanna talk about financials now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.52,0:46:31.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Normally, it's just 10%,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.68,0:46:33.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I figure with Stonebanks in the equation,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.56,0:46:37.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I might wanna get my fee, well, possibly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.84,0:46:39.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.20,0:46:40.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, not that you're not good for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.00,0:46:42.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.32,0:46:44.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.52,0:46:47.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you don't have too much faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.08,0:46:49.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.76,0:47:19.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,How was your vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.84,0:47:21.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready to go to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.32,0:47:22.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you find him yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.88,0:47:26.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's in Bucharest putting together a deal with some Albanian mobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.40,0:47:28.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got 36 hours. That's your window.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.84,0:47:30.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,After that, he's back off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.36,0:47:34.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Satellite map. Coordinates for where he'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.52,0:47:40.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Interesting guy, your friend Stonebanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.20,0:47:42.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.00,0:47:44.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,but they want him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.76,0:47:46.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.64,0:47:48.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,They wanna try him at The Hague
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.56,0:47:51.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,for war crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.12,0:47:54.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna give this guy a chance in court?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.16,0:47:55.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.60,0:47:59.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Never is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.40,0:48:01.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's the way it's gotta be.   - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.16,0:48:07.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Agency's got a local safe house. You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.48,0:48:10.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't trash the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.52,0:48:58.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Heard you got a job.   - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.36,0:49:01.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:02.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.12,0:49:07.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.52,0:49:10.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gunner, I told you everything I had to tell you back at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.12,0:49:11.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop drinking so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.88,0:49:16.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna get yourself killed. With those youngsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.40,0:49:20.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do us all a favor and get the hell outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.28,0:49:24.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wheels up in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.72,0:49:28.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.56,0:49:38.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,If your guys wanted to fight, why didn't they just get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.64,0:49:42.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're seriously smoking next to aviation fuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.76,0:49:50.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.56,0:49:53.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Amateur assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.00,0:49:55.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling asshole, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.60,0:49:58.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Grandpa's about to crush your windpipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.48,0:50:03.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this? Your toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.32,0:50:05.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.92,0:50:07.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You wanna dance, big guy?   - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.92,0:50:11.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.48,0:50:14.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.44,0:50:18.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bunch of has-beens still trying to be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.16,0:50:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're young and you're dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.20,0:50:31.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jing-a-ling, jing-a-ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.40,0:50:37.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep it. You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.44,0:50:50.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never thought you would call in that favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.92,0:50:52.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't look so happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.92,0:51:25.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.68,0:51:29.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the least of your worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.20,0:51:32.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, here's an idea, how about we focus on the assignment?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.80,0:51:34.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, does anyone know anything about this Stonebanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.76,0:51:38.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks was SASR.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.56,0:51:44.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Australian Special Forces.   - And that's all you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.96,0:51:46.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, it's more than you two know.   - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.48,0:51:48.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, you're both useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.48,0:51:50.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here's another idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:54.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you assholes take it outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.00,0:52:14.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.52,0:52:18.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.16,0:52:21.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me more about this guy we're going after.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.88,0:52:24.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter. You were hired to do a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.24,0:52:28.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,How 'bout answering why we're doing this job?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.68,0:52:34.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I owe you a salary. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.28,0:52:40.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are we going after Stonebanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.76,0:52:42.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have a hard time taking orders, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.08,0:52:45.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,If I don't know what they are, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.00,0:52:52.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you don't give a damn about us. I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.84,0:52:56.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,But just tell me why you wanna take out this guy so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.32,0:54:57.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thirty seconds to drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.96,0:54:58.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.56,0:55:01.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.48,0:55:07.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.96,0:55:10.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty seconds to drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.76,0:55:15.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.64,0:56:16.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.80,0:56:29.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,This guy's got more muscle than a cartel king.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.72,0:56:31.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's overcompensating for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.40,0:56:32.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you drinking down there, Barney?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.48,0:56:33.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that a vanilla latte or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.56,0:56:34.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.64,0:56:35.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Luna? Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.12,0:56:38.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think again, mister, because I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.96,0:56:41.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise this won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.44,0:56:43.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Move the car.   - I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.44,0:57:05.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice driving, Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.68,0:57:06.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.96,0:57:10.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, too good. Any closer and I'd beat his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.32,0:57:11.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I believe her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.68,0:57:12.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.20,0:57:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, this guy's protected better than the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.40,0:57:25.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and his crib's like a five-star fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.20,0:57:26.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why we're not taking him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.52,0:57:29.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the hotel is full of guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.44,0:57:31.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So where do we hit him?   - At the meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.92,0:57:34.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,We hit him from all four sides. Hit him hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.88,0:57:39.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Um, so, our plan is to, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.04,0:57:41.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kick down the door and start spraying bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.84,0:57:44.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a great plan if it was 1985.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.28,0:57:46.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.88,0:57:48.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.32,0:57:54.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You got a better plan?   - Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.36,0:57:55.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.76,0:57:57.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thorn, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.04,0:58:00.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm the plan. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.72,0:58:03.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,This ought to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.92,0:58:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,First, I hack the security grid main server.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.84,0:58:09.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boom. Bypass the motion-detector lasers and biometric sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.24,0:58:12.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pow. Override the surveillance video and CCTV systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.00,0:58:15.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ba-bam. And we are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.56,0:58:17.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's child's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.92,0:58:20.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just like that?   - Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.36,0:58:22.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.04,0:58:24.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exactly like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.64,0:58:31.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,You better be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.96,0:58:35.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.36,0:59:06.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, Why'd you let your team go?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.72,0:59:11.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you stick around long enough, you're gonna buy it. it was time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.40,0:59:14.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,They didn't seem too happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.96,0:59:16.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're looking to go the family route,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.20,0:59:22.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,it's the wrong job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.16,0:59:25.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are different kinds of family.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.88,0:59:29.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,And when my life is on the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.48,0:59:31.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,it's my family fighting with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.32,0:59:39.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.52,0:59:42.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.63,0:59:58.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.60,1:00:04.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.68,1:00:06.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go ahead then, Thorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.12,1:00:07.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you shut up and get in the sewer?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.28,1:00:54.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.14,1:01:24.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,And, ladies and gentlemen, we officially have eyes in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.28,1:01:25.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Copy that. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.96,1:01:27.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thought you'd never ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.80,1:02:10.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.80,1:02:12.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good luck, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.44,1:02:34.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.24,1:02:35.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.60,1:02:37.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,The buyer. They're early.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.56,1:02:38.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Threat just doubled.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.04,1:02:55.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're early.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.36,1:02:58.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.20,1:03:01.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.40,1:03:12.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,When Cain slew his brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.80,1:03:14.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,God banished him
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.00,1:03:16.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,from civilization.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.68,1:03:18.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,But before that, he placed a mark on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.20,1:03:22.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not as a felon's brand,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.40,1:03:25.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,but to protect him from roving hunters.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.80,1:03:30.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Customs does not X-ray artwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.08,1:03:31.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,It ruins the oils.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.52,1:03:32.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.44,1:03:36.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.08,1:03:40.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Pleasure.   - As always.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.56,1:03:47.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you access nuclear weapons?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.24,1:03:53.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I might.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.28,1:03:58.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,But, generally, I find people are a little too emotional for ownership.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.76,1:04:00.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'd hate you killing all my other customers by accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.12,1:04:03.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.68,1:04:06.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,In position.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.32,1:04:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,In position.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.48,1:04:11.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Set.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.76,1:04:13.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I pay you what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.48,1:04:15.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.20,1:04:37.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.32,1:04:43.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks is moving, watch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.49,1:04:51.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Try again.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.80,1:04:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Open sesame.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.48,1:04:59.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.31,1:05:13.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Luna? Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:19.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney Ross says hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.16,1:05:28.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.72,1:05:32.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Trench, you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.68,1:05:35.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.92,1:05:37.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Package secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.36,1:05:39.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry up. It's boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.32,1:05:52.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just put a bullet in his head and be done with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.12,1:06:04.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey! You said we were taking him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.52,1:06:08.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Good mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.80,1:06:14.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are these your students?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.76,1:06:18.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, kids. What'd you learn tonight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.52,1:06:19.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what happened to the old crew?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.00,1:06:22.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.72,1:06:25.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,They stuck their noses into other people's worlds
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.16,1:06:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,And got fatally injured.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.96,1:06:28.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now they're the Deletables.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.16,1:06:31.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! You hear that, kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.52,1:06:33.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take note, 'cause that's what you're doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.24,1:06:35.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we shut his mouth?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.48,1:06:38.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're talking pretty tough to a guy who's incapacitated, which is good for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.68,1:06:40.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.60,1:06:42.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you cut me loose? I'll open your meat shirt and show you your own heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.28,1:06:46.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Barn.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.92,1:06:49.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't the two of us just end this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.92,1:06:52.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you say? Mix it up...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.44,1:06:55.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Either you snapping my spine or me snapping yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.52,1:06:56.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know? Make it snappy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:07:00.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,He thinks I'm joking. I'm not joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.20,1:07:02.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should see me when I'm angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.24,1:07:04.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd be very impressed. Then very dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.00,1:07:10.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, come on, pal. Anything you wanna get off your chest?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.76,1:07:15.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, lay it out. I'm a good listener.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.04,1:07:20.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gonna take me back to the Has-Been Crew?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.36,1:07:23.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carve me up around a fire? Very tribal.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.84,1:07:27.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we stop,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.24,1:07:31.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna break every bone in your body.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.56,1:07:34.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,And drop what's left at The Hague.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.20,1:07:37.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Hague.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.52,1:07:40.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I finally made the big time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.32,1:07:41.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a war criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.92,1:07:43.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep laughin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.88,1:07:50.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you think that you can just deliver me like a package?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.04,1:07:57.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were close once.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.12,1:08:00.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,See, we started this whole Expendables thing together.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.60,1:08:02.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? Look, I've got the marks.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.84,1:08:06.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,A bit faded, but we had a falling out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.68,1:08:08.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You went dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.96,1:08:10.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a dark business, Barney.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.20,1:08:11.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you're not in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.24,1:08:15.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,The baddest survive. Those are the rules. I didn't make 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.96,1:08:20.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, Barney here was content to work for the small-end money, as an employee.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.20,1:08:22.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, being boss is more lucrative.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.68,1:08:24.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,But that's a concept that somehow eluded you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.52,1:08:27.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Plus, you've got that pesky moral conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.04,1:08:30.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,God, that stuff gets in the way. He thinks he's the good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.00,1:08:32.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Keep talkin' while you can.   - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.08,1:08:34.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a conscience, and that makes you weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.40,1:08:36.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Success, real success
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.68,1:08:40.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,is being willing to do the things that other people are not.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.60,1:08:42.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not everyone's as sick as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.12,1:08:44.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, but you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.16,1:08:47.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you kill anyone today, Barn? Blow any shit up?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.32,1:08:51.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,How 'bout you, kids? Kill anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.84,1:08:55.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Before you all start grabbing bricks to stone me at The Hague,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.52,1:08:59.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,you might wanna check your own hands for blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.84,1:09:03.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I digress. Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.52,1:09:05.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. Business is booming, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.28,1:09:08.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,A chopper here, a missile there. Guns, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.68,1:09:13.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,When suddenly, a competitor, if you can call Uncle Sam a competitor,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.68,1:09:17.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,hires my own team, Barney and the whole gang to whack me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.56,1:09:19.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Things got ugly real fast and a lot of people got dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.06,1:09:20.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Things got ugly real fast and a lot of people got dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.64,1:09:22.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three former brothers-in-arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.36,1:09:23.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.48,1:09:25.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three Expendables, our brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.08,1:09:27.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Men we ate with, fought with, bled with.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.48,1:09:30.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dead. He puts three slugs into my chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.20,1:09:32.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank God for body armor. Even I thought I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.04,1:09:34.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then he boogies out with the casualties.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.00,1:09:37.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,All dead because you couldn't stay out of my business!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.04,1:09:40.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.08,1:09:41.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on, do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.68,1:09:43.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Go on!   - It's what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.04,1:10:01.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's hard to fathom. I can't believe you forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.64,1:10:02.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.92,1:10:06.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,That it's hard to beat an enemy when he's living inside your own head.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.80,1:10:10.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,See, you tie me up like an animal,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.36,1:10:14.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,lead me to the slaughter. You humiliate me, disgrace me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.36,1:10:16.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, when the time comes to kill you,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.52,1:10:19.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,And it will, I will not use a weapon, I will use my hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.88,1:10:22.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I want you to feel the way that I feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.12,1:10:28.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus, we were brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.80,1:10:34.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.16,1:10:36.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a GPS tracker! It's a GPS tracker!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.60,1:10:38.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,How 'bout that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.28,1:12:00.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.80,1:12:05.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,We may need 'em. I need a body. Find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.96,1:13:30.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.64,1:13:32.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,We found a shitstorm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.16,1:13:35.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's gonna get worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.28,1:13:38.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,This came in for you 10 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.60,1:13:43.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Barney!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.36,1:13:46.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,My search party's dead, so I'm taking it you're still with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.48,1:13:48.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, you should've killed me when you had the chance
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.28,1:13:50.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,'cause that's your last window. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.64,1:13:52.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I got something to show you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.64,1:13:56.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got Harpo, Groucho,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.20,1:13:58.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gummo and Chica! Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.20,1:14:02.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, give her a little squeeze there, Krug.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.20,1:14:04.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.80,1:14:08.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Personally, I'd chalk it up to collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.32,1:14:11.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't give a fuck. But I know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.48,1:14:13.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forty-eight hours and they're gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.04,1:14:17.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you want 'em, come get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.36,1:14:19.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.12,1:14:51.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looking a little strung-out there, kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.04,1:14:55.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,And this is what you get for being pawns in Barney's moral chess game.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.20,1:14:58.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,That one looks a little slack.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.08,1:15:06.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I feel most bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.28,1:15:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.20,1:15:12.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I do. I have a daughter. I have feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.48,1:15:14.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you know, when the CIA...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.64,1:15:16.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I presume that's who you're working for.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.88,1:15:18.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,The CIA. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.32,1:15:22.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I bet you don't even know who you're working for.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.28,1:15:26.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,What, for Barney? Do you know who he's working for?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.64,1:15:31.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does he know who he's working... It gets very confusing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.20,1:15:33.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyway, when the CIA wanted guys
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.92,1:15:37.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,doing the dangerous work in the dangerous places, they called us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.12,1:15:40.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,When they didn't wanna get their hands dirty, they called us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.68,1:15:44.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yep. We cleared every hotspot they had.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.44,1:15:49.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We bumped the bad guys so that the good guys could roll in lookin' like heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.08,1:15:55.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,We killed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.60,1:16:00.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we saved more lives than you can possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.92,1:16:06.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then, the boys on the Hill, wanting no loose ends,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.80,1:16:09.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,tried to bury me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.96,1:16:11.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was an American
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.52,1:16:13.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,working for America.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.36,1:16:15.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Was.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.28,1:16:18.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'd eat their own children.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.60,1:16:22.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,The lesson here is
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.28,1:16:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,never do business with the government.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.20,1:16:32.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna save you that heartache. You never will.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.00,1:16:47.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you're getting your old team?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.32,1:16:49.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I burned that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.12,1:16:50.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, your pride is gonna get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.80,1:16:52.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Better me than them.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.08,1:16:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So, you're really gonna go back?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.24,1:16:56.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alone?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.20,1:16:58.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.00,1:17:00.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.64,1:17:03.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess our favors are done.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.60,1:17:09.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you're still an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.12,1:17:38.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.00,1:17:42.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,People talk. I hear things.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.88,1:17:45.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a mission. I can help.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.04,1:17:48.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,My name is Galgo.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.76,1:17:50.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me fill you in. l am good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.36,1:17:53.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Very good. At warfare.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.60,1:17:55.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, good memory. Afraid of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.84,1:17:58.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.00,1:18:00.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't need a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.76,1:18:04.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, you do. Everybody does.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.72,1:18:08.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't have any friends. That's why I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.96,1:18:14.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,But besides my friendship issues, what I really need now is something to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.08,1:18:19.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, not just anything, but what I was born to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.60,1:18:21.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Best bet, this is a one-way trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.28,1:18:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.16,1:18:27.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,but one-way trip is better than no way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.00,1:18:29.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which is the way I live now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.64,1:18:37.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help me with the crate.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.60,1:18:41.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.96,1:18:45.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,On the plane, Gogo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.48,1:18:46.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,On the plane. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.00,1:18:49.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gogo? No, I'm not Gogo. No, Galgo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.44,1:18:51.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Galgo. Gogo sounds like a Parisian hooker.   - Galgo.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.88,1:19:07.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,"I am the bridegroom of death."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.96,1:19:10.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Those are the lyrics of a Spanish Legion old song
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.80,1:19:12.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,that we used to sing when we were on a mission in Croatia.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.00,1:19:15.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, that's where I met Mingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.84,1:19:18.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The best point man ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.32,1:19:21.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some kind of savant, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.64,1:19:23.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,No ambush this guy couldn't sniff.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.68,1:19:25.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,And under fire, the coolest cat ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.60,1:19:27.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just pure ice in his veins.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.04,1:19:30.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were pinned down once, like, two bullets left.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.20,1:19:34.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I looked over. Not one bead of sweat.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.72,1:19:36.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Was cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.16,1:19:42.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Can I help you up there?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.84,1:19:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a mechanic now?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.20,1:19:46.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course I am a mechanic. I am whatever you need me to be, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.92,1:19:48.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, then just be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.00,1:19:50.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.04,1:19:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.65,1:19:54.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,This sniper I knew, I mean, this guy got it all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.80,1:19:56.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wind speed, temperature.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.60,1:19:59.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit, barometric pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.24,1:20:01.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,But do you know what he said was the most important?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.08,1:20:03.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No.   - Patience.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.68,1:20:06.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Really?   - Yeah, he said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.04,1:20:10.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,This thing smells good. What is that? Is it kerosene? Gasoline?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.48,1:20:11.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.52,1:20:13.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Aviation fuel.   - Aviation fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.36,1:20:16.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.68,1:20:20.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,The best team member ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.72,1:20:23.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,His name was Torres. Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.24,1:20:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe what this guy was capable to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.72,1:20:29.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.24,1:20:30.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Galgo.   - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.56,1:20:32.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I know why your team let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.72,1:20:36.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You do? Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.12,1:20:41.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.72,1:20:53.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Big plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.40,1:20:57.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Old, old, but cool, ya know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.56,1:20:59.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where are the others?   - Just us.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.88,1:21:01.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just us?   - Just us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.96,1:21:03.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.20,1:21:05.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Courageous, but insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.44,1:21:06.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.00,1:21:08.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You sure you wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.04,1:21:11.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like traveling.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.36,1:21:12.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.52,1:21:37.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh... Who are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.24,1:21:38.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,My old team.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.64,1:21:51.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.88,1:21:54.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were stupid enough to get yourself into this mess!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.88,1:21:58.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones crazy enough to get you out of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.72,1:22:03.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. We're late for a war!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.32,1:22:13.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Galgo, you might wanna get outta that seat. Christmas is comin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.84,1:22:15.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,But it's June.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.88,1:22:17.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Galgo, get the hell out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.72,1:22:23.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. My hat and gloves.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.76,1:22:32.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm curious.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.08,1:22:34.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Since when did suicide become your hobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.28,1:22:35.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got a will.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.28,1:22:38.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm probably the only friend you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.68,1:22:39.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.96,1:22:41.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You walk into a room, people jump under tables.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.24,1:22:45.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I missed you, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.04,1:22:48.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I missed you, too, you demented bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.48,1:22:50.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could've left the "demented" out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.56,1:22:56.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a kind of a solid structure that is taking us from one place to another
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.64,1:22:58.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,to unbelievable speeds.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.20,1:23:00.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think about it! If God...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.12,1:23:02.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,If God, if he would have liked us,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.04,1:23:06.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,you know, flying, he would have given us feathers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.28,1:23:07.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have feathers?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.44,1:23:08.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have feathers? Do you have feathers?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.64,1:23:09.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't have feathers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.80,1:23:12.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn. This is gonna be a long-ass flight, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.12,1:23:14.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's going to be. It's going to be a long flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.92,1:23:18.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,But don't worry. I'm here. Man, because I can't sleep on planes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.92,1:23:20.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.00,1:23:22.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you should know, Barney,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.44,1:23:23.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,you're walking into a shitstorm.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.96,1:23:27.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,NSA ran a signals and frequency check on your team's phones.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.80,1:23:29.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,This bastard's not even trying to hide 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.96,1:23:32.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's he taken 'em?   - They're in Azmenistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.36,1:23:33.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another honeymoon hotspot.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.08,1:23:35.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.28,1:23:36.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lee Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.76,1:23:38.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not far off, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.64,1:23:41.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks' compound is where he trains his goons.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.84,1:23:43.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's very heavily fortified.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.68,1:23:45.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up with the local army?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.16,1:23:47.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't understand a word this guy is sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.40,1:23:48.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Local army status.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.12,1:23:51.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Small. Corrupt.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.20,1:23:53.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stonebanks' has got all the brass in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.48,1:23:56.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Been running his operations through
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.16,1:23:57.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,this shithole of a country for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.16,1:24:00.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Want some advice?   - What's the advice?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.32,1:24:02.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What goddamn language is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.52,1:24:04.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, to tell you the truth, I don't understand you either.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.60,1:24:05.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look who's talkin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.68,1:24:07.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the advice, Drummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.16,1:24:09.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forget about what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.16,1:24:11.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember our deal. We need him alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.16,1:24:12.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,So he can sit in a courtroom
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.68,1:24:14.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,and beat this on a technicality?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.40,1:24:16.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Those are orders, Barney.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.72,1:24:19.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You broke the phone.   - I got another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.52,1:24:23.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think we'll make it back from this one?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.00,1:24:26.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to come along, Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.40,1:24:28.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.72,1:24:31.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Morons need friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.68,1:24:40.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.12,1:24:59.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is it? This is your evac team?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.88,1:25:00.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Short notice.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.04,1:25:03.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, very short.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.08,1:25:06.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's your team, Major Drummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.32,1:25:08.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,No team. This one's off the books.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.72,1:25:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not even here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.56,1:25:13.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.32,1:25:17.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought Church was asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.92,1:25:22.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,The only army in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.28,1:25:26.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Guys, did I tell you about Pepito?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.00,1:25:29.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Small name, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.00,1:25:33.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I saw him lift a deuce and a half of a guy once.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.60,1:25:35.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love that tattoo, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.68,1:25:38.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like that kind of, black chicken that you have there. What is that called?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.16,1:25:42.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,A craw. The craw over the skull. I love to do something...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.76,1:25:48.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hysterical strength. Weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.16,1:25:50.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Weird concept.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.68,1:25:54.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you are hysterically strong, you don't even have to go to the gym.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.80,1:25:57.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are just strong. You just got it. You just got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.76,1:25:59.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,But hysterical is a concept that actually
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.88,1:26:02.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,was applied to women in the 19th century.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.24,1:26:06.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a decimononic concept. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.76,1:26:08.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. This is an interesting place.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.04,1:26:11.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He gave me a migraine.   - I hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.72,1:26:13.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you think? A bit cold, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.68,1:26:14.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.04,1:26:17.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You run out of bullets, he can talk 'em to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.32,1:26:18.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.72,1:26:20.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tall one doesn't like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.92,1:26:22.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He doesn't like anybody.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.60,1:26:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What'd you say?   - He likes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.76,1:26:35.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.92,1:26:39.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What?   - That computer strapped to your wrist?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.20,1:26:41.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.28,1:26:43.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the same thing you were busting that kid's balls about?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.76,1:26:45.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I had it for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.28,1:26:57.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why'd your team let you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.88,1:27:03.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why does it matter now?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.12,1:27:05.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna know who I'm working with.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.28,1:27:10.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, they aren't around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.60,1:27:17.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, listen, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.72,1:27:23.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,So Why'd they let you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.64,1:27:25.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,They didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.08,1:27:36.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Benghazi.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.28,1:27:40.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was not in the army anymore and we were
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.72,1:27:44.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,retrieving a hostage, something like...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.80,1:27:48.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like we are doing here, and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.80,1:27:53.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was... A beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.96,1:27:56.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,No problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.68,1:27:59.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then it all went bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.36,1:28:03.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got hit. Cut off.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.28,1:28:06.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Waited for support. No one came.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.44,1:28:09.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.12,1:28:14.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody died.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.00,1:28:19.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Except me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.84,1:28:21.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mingo,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.12,1:28:24.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Torres, and Tiger, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.80,1:28:30.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,You were listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.00,1:28:32.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.52,1:28:36.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.48,1:29:16.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.08,1:29:21.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we should get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.78,1:29:51.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Four signals.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.80,1:29:53.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eight stories up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.28,1:29:57.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is way too wrong. Sally don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.04,1:29:59.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know he's got eyes on us now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.08,1:30:01.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,May I suggest something?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.76,1:30:03.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No, later.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.72,1:30:06.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.00,1:31:13.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.88,1:31:45.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Break it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.36,1:31:53.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.80,1:31:54.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.08,1:31:59.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Barn!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.68,1:32:03.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I knew you couldn't stay away.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.00,1:32:06.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'm relieved that someone could pick up the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.64,1:32:07.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got 'em in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.68,1:32:10.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now try getting 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.24,1:32:12.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.08,1:32:16.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,the entire complex has been wired with C-4.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.68,1:32:19.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,It'd take a regular Joe about 90 seconds to get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.04,1:32:21.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got... How 'bout 45?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.41,1:32:37.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's turned this whole place into a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.71,1:32:41.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.28,1:32:49.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,9% battery power. You didn't charge it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.36,1:32:51.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.56,1:32:52.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just running some code. Should be able to jam the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.92,1:32:55.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.12,1:32:56.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I use it to check the weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.36,1:32:58.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you just shut up and let him do his thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.12,1:32:59.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You sure you can do this, Thorn?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.52,1:33:00.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can do it. I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.80,1:33:06.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, kid, take your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.16,1:33:08.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, man. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.56,1:33:09.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.00,1:33:11.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on. Come on!   - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.56,1:33:13.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on, Thorn. Come on, Thorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.16,1:33:15.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.44,1:33:18.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Source is in.   - You can do it. Come on, Thorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.16,1:33:20.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.48,1:33:21.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Focus. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.28,1:33:24.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.96,1:33:26.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.52,1:33:33.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've lost override. The signal is jammed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.76,1:33:35.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Send 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.74,1:33:41.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney, the battery's at 8%. When this thing dies, we lose override.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.48,1:33:43.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,That gives us about 25 minutes, tops.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.18,1:33:49.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't pop the bottles yet. Still got trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.85,1:33:50.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What?   - Big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.68,1:34:05.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucky again, bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.80,1:34:07.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,But try to enjoy the view because
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.48,1:34:09.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,shortly, the building that you're currently standing in
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.00,1:34:12.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,will be surrounded by the Azmenistan army.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.68,1:34:14.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.80,1:34:16.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you shitheads manage to get captured anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.68,1:34:17.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.92,1:34:25.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Step back!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.20,1:34:28.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not an accident
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.36,1:34:30.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,that we're trapped in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.16,1:34:33.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what he knew would happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.36,1:34:36.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Us tearing at each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.76,1:34:39.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It stops now!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.56,1:34:41.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.36,1:34:43.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,But only if we do this
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.40,1:34:45.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,together.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.84,1:34:48.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we work as a team,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.40,1:34:51.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,we just may get out of this alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.60,1:34:57.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, do you wanna make it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.52,1:34:59.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,That simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.40,1:35:01.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got any weapons?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.56,1:35:04.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here's the plan. We're gonna break up into small groups
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.60,1:35:05.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,and go out through the ground floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.00,1:35:07.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.24,1:35:08.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.88,1:35:35.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thorn, you stay with me. You take Galgo.   - I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.64,1:36:01.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't stop. One there. One there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.44,1:36:18.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's too many!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.08,1:36:21.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're on our flank! Bring it to 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.08,1:36:23.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.88,1:36:42.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Enough's enough. Light 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.12,1:36:50.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.84,1:37:03.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Up the shaft, Thorn. You gotta protect that signal jammer.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.20,1:37:22.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you could fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.28,1:38:13.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.80,1:38:15.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.04,1:38:19.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Totally fine! Totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.24,1:38:22.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,And full of energy. You know, we are brothers now!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.88,1:38:24.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good, keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.76,1:38:25.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.00,1:39:15.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.00,1:39:17.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told you you'd give yourself a stroke.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.16,1:39:19.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drummer?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.24,1:39:20.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a tank problem, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.00,1:39:22.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.56,1:39:23.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.16,1:39:27.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Trench, on your right!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.32,1:39:36.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's gotta hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.68,1:39:42.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drummer's in the house!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.28,1:40:01.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.04,1:40:08.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.52,1:40:11.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Time to pick up the tempo, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.24,1:40:28.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not good. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.48,1:41:19.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is not happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.12,1:41:20.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna do something?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.16,1:41:49.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull me down! Pull me...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.88,1:41:52.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.60,1:42:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.56,1:42:12.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.44,1:42:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.32,1:42:20.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yang, hit something.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.04,1:42:28.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.68,1:42:39.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your name is Luna, right? Luna means "moon."
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.96,1:42:44.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hypnotic, mysterious, magical, like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.56,1:42:50.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you like to hold my gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.48,1:43:20.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, drive this thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.48,1:43:24.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,My mom drove a tank back in Sweden.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.48,1:43:31.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,This one's for Caesar, assholes!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.96,1:43:35.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah!   - Damn, that's cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.56,1:44:23.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I had it all under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.56,1:44:25.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what it looked like.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.84,1:44:45.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.60,1:46:33.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the happiest moment of my life!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.80,1:46:56.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jing-a-ling, jing-a-ling.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.92,1:47:14.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You finished yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.20,1:47:40.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.48,1:47:44.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're not gonna believe this.   - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.20,1:47:46.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about you the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.16,1:47:47.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- During the whole fight.   - Can we just go?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.56,1:47:52.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.12,1:47:55.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.64,1:48:00.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn how to fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.36,1:48:01.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Trench, you're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.96,1:48:17.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney! We got reinforcements!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.92,1:48:28.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.20,1:48:38.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drummer, there's another wave coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.12,1:48:40.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,The only way out is up.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.84,1:48:43.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,On my way. Evac in five.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.68,1:48:44.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.76,1:48:46.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody get to the roof now!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.84,1:48:47.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.76,1:48:57.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Trench. Yang. Come on, clear the roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.08,1:48:58.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.44,1:49:56.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Always this easy? Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.48,1:49:58.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,How hard can it be to kill 10 men?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.56,1:50:00.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think you could even just wound a couple?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.64,1:50:01.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.36,1:50:03.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,And again.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.72,1:50:05.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.32,1:50:07.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Useless bunch of...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.40,1:50:12.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you want something done right...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.64,1:50:34.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,They got valet parking here?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.52,1:50:37.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's some right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.28,1:50:39.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.28,1:51:02.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.64,1:51:04.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.60,1:51:28.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drummer, we're pinned down!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.08,1:51:29.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop mumbling.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.12,1:51:34.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.88,1:51:36.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the chopper!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.40,1:51:37.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.72,1:51:39.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go! Come on, move, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.84,1:51:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gotta go, gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.72,1:51:48.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yang?   - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.36,1:51:49.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're working for Trench?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.80,1:51:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He pay me more money.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.76,1:51:54.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.04,1:51:56.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the guy that just saved your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.60,1:52:01.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Battery's at 2%.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.44,1:52:08.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Barney, leaving so soon?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.60,1:52:10.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.76,1:52:17.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,How ya feelin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.08,1:52:25.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, stand up. You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.80,1:52:33.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.84,1:52:40.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lose the armor. I want you to feel this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.24,1:52:42.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney, we gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.76,1:52:48.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,And don't even think about going for that piece of garbage in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.20,1:52:53.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.44,1:52:54.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.80,1:52:55.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.00,1:53:05.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, we don't need these, do we?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.08,1:53:15.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.44,1:53:18.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney, we've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.72,1:53:32.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Battery's at 1%!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.24,1:53:33.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Barney!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.96,1:54:07.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.04,1:54:19.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about The Hague, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.36,1:54:22.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am The Hague.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.84,1:54:33.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Battery's gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.36,1:54:39.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gotta go! Gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.68,1:54:41.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No, wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.32,1:54:42.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.72,1:54:53.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,CHRISTMAS; Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.64,1:54:56.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Barney! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.92,1:55:04.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.48,1:55:05.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You owe me, Barney.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.52,1:55:09.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney! Barney!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.40,1:55:14.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Holy...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.56,1:55:52.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull me up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.04,1:55:55.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gonna fire us again, Barney?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.68,1:55:56.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.40,1:55:58.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't hear you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.80,1:56:00.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.40,1:56:07.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm sorry! Pull me up, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.40,1:56:10.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't pull him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.28,1:56:28.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,To Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.96,1:56:30.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.88,1:56:33.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.52,1:56:41.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, yo, Barney.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.92,1:56:43.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm gonna be needing this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.24,1:56:45.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want your luck back?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.16,1:56:52.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't stretch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.80,1:56:54.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you did stretch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.40,1:56:56.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good to have you back, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.96,1:56:58.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't scare us like that anymore, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.76,1:57:00.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hale Caesar.   - To me!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.56,1:57:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never got him to The Hague.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.92,1:57:15.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, Drummer, working with you ain't been so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.64,1:57:21.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't had so much fun in years.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.32,1:57:22.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fun's important.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.16,1:57:27.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,These guys are nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.56,1:57:28.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our powers combined...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.64,1:57:31.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that a Captain Planet reference?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.68,1:57:33.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm fire.   - Yeah, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.00,1:57:35.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, if you had to be a Planeteer...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.36,1:57:36.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you calling Captain Planet?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.84,1:57:39.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Major old-school.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.16,1:57:40.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Major Badass.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.52,1:57:42.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.92,1:57:45.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am sure
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.16,1:57:49.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have done enough that I am worth my weight in gold, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.44,1:57:54.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I close? And since I am as crazy as you,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.12,1:57:56.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,uh, l am sure I'll fit in.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.64,1:57:58.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Galgo.   - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.48,1:58:05.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.36,1:58:07.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank God!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.52,1:58:10.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I already spent a fortune on this. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.00,1:58:12.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am so happy!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.72,1:58:15.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barney, thank you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.72,1:58:18.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no. No, no hugging, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.16,1:58:19.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,No hugging. No hugging
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.72,1:58:21.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,No hugging. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.04,1:58:43.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Best two out of three.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.24,1:58:47.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just wanted to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.68,1:58:50.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- For what?   - For caring.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.40,1:58:51.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.72,1:58:54.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.08,1:58:55.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, if you were 30 years younger...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.24,1:58:56.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd be afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.48,1:58:58.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.40,1:59:03.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yang. Looks like you had a growth spurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.60,1:59:05.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tall people don't live long.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.76,1:59:08.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you're working for Trench now.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.84,1:59:11.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you, I thought you retired.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.04,1:59:13.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I lied.   - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.44,1:59:22.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys wanna get a room?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.80,1:59:27.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't need any rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.64,1:59:29.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,So jealous.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.80,1:59:33.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We came into this thing together, we gonna leave here together.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.12,1:59:34.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hear me?   - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.52,1:59:36.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cheers.   - Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.60,1:59:42.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, for a guy that doesn't take orders very well,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.96,1:59:44.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,you did pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.80,1:59:45.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.64,1:59:48.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,So when do I take over?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.28,1:59:50.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep drinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.76,1:59:52.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Smilee!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.56,1:59:54.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.64,1:59:57.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did good, kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.00,2:00:20.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Old man, look at my life ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.97,2:00:24.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Twenty-four and there's so much more ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.80,2:00:27.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Live alone in a paradise ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.68,2:00:30.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ That makes me think of two ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.60,2:00:34.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,∮ Love lost, such a cost... ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.01,2:00:39.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look like a proud, demented father.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.68,2:00:42.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,You coulda skipped the "demented" part.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.56,2:00:45.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.30,2:02:25.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,《敢死队3》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:53.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,(监狱装甲押运列车)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经抓住了逃犯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:01:00.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在要把犯人带回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,(丹萨里监狱)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:44.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,幸运戒指戴上了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.24,0:01:46.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉安全多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:48.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧了,准备开战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:46.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:18.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,磨蹭什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:22.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,马上就完,快走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:42.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,这哥们儿在梦游吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,医生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,别管这疯子了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会扔下他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,医生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,医生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:54.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,快上来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:41.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是来看我的吗,都过了八年了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这是干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:46.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你被关在了一个外界不知道的秘密监狱里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我从一个叫教堂的人那儿打听到了方位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个人是个密探
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:52.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是政府部门的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:57.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在才来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:01.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,浪费我多少生命,我就犯了一次错误
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:04.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是犯错,那是犯二
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:06.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你再敢那样对我,我就把你大卸八块
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,有本事你试试
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:10.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,谢谢兄弟们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:14.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟们,我们的兄弟呢,铁锤呢,樵夫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,都不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,彻底不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:25.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,听说你杀的人不计其数
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:42.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,很牛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以大家叫你死神医生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:46.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是当过医生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:50.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过很久以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:52.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会被关起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:55.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为逃税
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:01.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,敢死队就剩下你们几个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:03.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:06.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,敢死队最早是五个人,后来发展到二十二人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看到巴尼还把身份牌挂在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:17.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,据说这些牌子会发出叮当声
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:19.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像在提醒我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:22.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些兄弟还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:24.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,活在某个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:27.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,行了,维京人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:31.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,把刀交给大叔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:36.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不然你的牌子也会挂在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:41.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,叮当叮当响,叮当叮当,叮当叮当
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:48.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,用完了磨快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:06.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的朋友神叨叨的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:09.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,很正常,他在那个洞里关了整整八年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:10.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他怎么进去的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:14.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,他为了一点儿小钱,在非洲东部的一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞了一次计划不周密的政治暗杀,结果失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来是自己作死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,差不多,就这样,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是一个好医生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:24.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我又没得病
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:25.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么说话老带刺儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:26.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你掏浆糊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 掏浆糊,老是绕来绕去  - 得了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:33.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么不远万里带我来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:36.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,救这么一个,你所谓的医学天才
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:37.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:38.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是敢死队的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,天呐,唬谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:41.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是敢死队的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:42.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:44.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:46.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你在牢里关了好几年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:48.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定会来救你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢了,英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才不信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:54.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你也会来救我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 想听真话  - 宁愿让我死在牢里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:57.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝对的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,医生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:07.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:08.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫圣诞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你真名
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:12.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,千真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,这也是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,不是,这个,是我每天早上花3个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,用黑色圆珠笔画上去的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:22.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这个,是真的,千真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,原创的,瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:32.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,平衡感有点退步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:36.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会使刀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:38.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝对是,最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,名气比圣诞节还要响
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.44,0:10:42.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,对吗,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:43.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:47.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我玩刀的时候,你大概还是,刚断奶的小屁孩儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:49.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,在学习怎么用勺子吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:53.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,这是你保守的另一个秘密吧,浆糊先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,别老猜我在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:57.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可是急着要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:01.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,吃点儿好的东西,穿上好的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:03.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐进我那辆庞蒂亚克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,使劲踩油门,直到发动机飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:08.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没告诉他,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:12.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不回家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:15.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,有个叫维克多·明斯的商人在运送温压炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:17.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要去阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:18.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,那玩意儿是地狱之火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:21.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是个常规任务
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:23.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不等完成任务之后再来接我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:25.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们正好缺人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:27.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很愿意跟你们一起玩儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过,我现在没有趁手的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:40.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是我的家伙  - 是你的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:47.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,医生,他们救你出来,你谢他们了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:11:59.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:04.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经很久没有找到,说谢谢的理由了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:07.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我只想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:11.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,越说越利索了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:13.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,态度相当诚恳呐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:22.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都要哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:23.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,伙计,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:27.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,别老跟刺儿头似的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:29.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说得很好,医生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:30.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很好  - 相当的好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,毕竟你已经很长时间没有说过话了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你很有天赋  - 你听了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像骑车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:36.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,超过丘吉尔的鼎盛时期
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:38.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 堪比葛底斯堡演说  - 我想我可能打动了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:39.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,打动了我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我也打动了你  - 震撼人心的演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:42.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,震撼人心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 医生  - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:52.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正也没别的地儿可去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:02.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,(索马利亚 摩加迪苏)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:28.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟你们说了,让你们慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 船不错  - 谢谢,女士们,我亲自偷的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:36.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有三艘这样的,在港口巡逻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:38.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,地面每隔400米有两人巡逻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,会开飞机不能代表你比我聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:42.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁说不能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:47.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,就因为你,他们把我丢在这破地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:50.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,破地方,你知道什么叫破吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这宝贝儿能解决你所有的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:01.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,能硬起10秒钟,然后就不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么说你也不行喽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:07.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你自找的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:10.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,行了,出发了,出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:24.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝大家好运
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,都在我控制之中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,看上去是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,他看见你了,他没有看见我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:33.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧医生去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:38.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不陪你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:41.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,新年快乐,你奶奶的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:46.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心上面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:18.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,医生,上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:57.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,小子,居然跟我玩刀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:02.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他挺厉害  - 得了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:10.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们该看看这个  - 看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:11.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:46.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,嚯,他真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再说一次,我就崩了你  - 安静
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:52.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:09.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,炸弹在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:10.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:14.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼,目标来得很准时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:17.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到明斯,我们尽快解决他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要把你们放下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:40.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不可能  - 什么不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:42.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,到底杀还是不杀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:43.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么不行动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:45.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,他早死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:47.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:56.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:07.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿,进去,进去,进去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼,快进来,快,快,快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,快,行动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,该修草坪了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:54.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说吧,就10秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:04.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,坚持住,给你们找了辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,该撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:32.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:34.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,走,走,走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:41.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这趟活儿能赚多少  - 多少都不够
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:57.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,往右
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:30.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们过不去  - 你老这么悲观
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:45.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都要吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.40,0:21:50.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,坚持住,医生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.52,0:21:52.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 右面  - 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:06.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.92,0:22:19.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯撒,我们来找你了,你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:34.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,在你后面,那条脏河里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:38.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你尽量靠我们近点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.48,0:22:45.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,给凯撒让个座
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:47.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿让开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:52.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,一条船加个黑大个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,全速前进,继续开
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:17.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没事儿吧  - 没事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:24.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:12.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,炸弹来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.00,0:24:16.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.30,0:26:18.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,(教区纪念医院)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望这戒指能帮你挺过去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.92,0:27:23.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他能挺过来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.04,0:27:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.16,0:27:26.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,是谁干的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:29.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:32.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不是被你杀了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.36,0:27:33.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:36.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他打凯撒是为了报复我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.88,0:27:40.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我准备洗手不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.88,0:27:42.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也该退了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:45.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在还不行
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.88,0:27:49.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果要人帮你对付斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.36,0:28:11.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要见的是个叫教堂的人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:12.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.08,0:28:14.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.12,0:28:16.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是行动指挥官,鼓手
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.56,0:28:19.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不用再担心教堂了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.04,0:28:23.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,他,跟我们没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.04,0:28:28.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,天呐,罗斯,真是一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.08,0:28:31.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们什么都给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.24,0:28:33.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,目标,机会
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.36,0:28:35.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有你需要的所有情报
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.88,0:28:38.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是你,却打了败仗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.00,0:28:41.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,让目标逃之夭夭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:44.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说错了吗,有什么不对
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.76,0:28:48.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,有,教堂说目标的名字叫维克多·明斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:50.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了  - 他弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.12,0:28:53.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个人的真名叫康拉德·斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.52,0:28:58.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只知道他叫维克多·明斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:03.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,军火贩子,亿万富豪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.24,0:29:04.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,靠倒卖武器给非洲和中东发家起家
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.96,0:29:06.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,他有自己的雇佣军部队
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.80,0:29:08.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是他,严刑拷打
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.28,0:29:11.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,并且杀死了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.24,0:29:13.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认识的,两个最优秀的人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.48,0:29:15.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,还都是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:18.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不在乎他到底叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:19.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我讨厌他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.48,0:29:22.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你一样想抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.56,0:29:25.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,这事就发生在我的眼皮底下
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.32,0:29:29.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你,把它搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.32,0:29:31.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我,还得给你扛着
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:36.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会想法再找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.60,0:29:39.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还有一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.04,0:29:43.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.48,0:29:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的人伤得不轻
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.16,0:29:52.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要怎么组建团队
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.32,0:29:55.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这你不用操心,我会搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.96,0:29:59.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,放松点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.48,0:30:03.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,老这么紧张容易中风
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.60,0:30:06.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,这都什么人呐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.20,0:30:08.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,让一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.46,0:30:16.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,(俄罗斯 莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.28,0:30:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,当画家画这幅画的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.20,0:30:46.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,压根没想到它能卖到这个天价
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.88,0:30:49.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过是些颜料,画笔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.88,0:30:52.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,便宜的画布,这有什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.20,0:30:59.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,狗屁不是,你开价多少
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.80,0:31:02.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 三百万  - 成交
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.40,0:31:05.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,成交
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.40,0:31:14.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,要知道,要知道,我真的很不愿跟你说这些
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.68,0:31:17.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们曾经是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.36,0:31:20.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许现在还是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.56,0:31:23.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是不会永远这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.76,0:31:30.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然很难接受
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.52,0:31:35.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,未来已经不属于我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.44,0:31:36.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,很遗憾我们老了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.44,0:31:39.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只属于过去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.92,0:31:46.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你,到底想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.60,0:31:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我看来,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.44,0:31:57.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们这些人只会有,一个结局
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.12,0:32:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,被埋进土里,连个来扫墓的人都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.64,0:32:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然这是我自己选的路,我能接受这个结局
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.44,0:32:13.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.28,0:32:17.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我不能接受
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.96,0:32:20.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,也不会接受
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:25.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,让你们跟着我这样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,说什么呢,我们是自愿的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.32,0:32:30.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要改变一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.84,0:32:35.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你,我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.44,0:32:38.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们大家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:44.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.12,0:32:46.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 散伙了  - 散伙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.00,0:32:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救我出来,然后甩了我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.00,0:32:51.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会适应的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:52.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都会
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.20,0:32:57.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧时间享受生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.04,0:33:03.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.20,0:33:17.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为说结束就能结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.20,0:33:18.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:20.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗,哪有你想的那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:22.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛  - 我们一起风风雨雨
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.68,0:33:24.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,流血流汗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.88,0:33:27.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都数不清救过你多少次了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.72,0:33:32.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要干掉那混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.84,0:33:36.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不会这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.40,0:33:47.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我入伙的时候,买的可是全程票
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.92,0:33:50.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.56,0:33:54.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,旅程结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.33,0:34:46.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,(内华达州 拉斯维加斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.32,0:35:16.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,波拿巴
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.20,0:35:19.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯撒的事我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.28,0:35:20.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,但愿他能挺过来,他这种好手可不多
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.44,0:35:21.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.80,0:35:24.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,又见面了,要我做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.36,0:35:27.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,组个新队,老队员都遣散了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.12,0:35:29.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到21世纪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.00,0:35:32.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,要找什么样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.16,0:35:35.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,年轻,有雄心,不怕吃枪子儿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:37.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,目标是斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.76,0:35:39.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.84,0:35:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟不上形势的人不止我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:43.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯通班克斯早翘辫子了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.84,0:35:45.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,他没死
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.60,0:35:49.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.92,0:35:50.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算他能力减半
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.04,0:35:52.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,也得五十个人才能对付得了他
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.12,0:35:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,时间紧迫,你得快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.52,0:35:55.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么着急
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:35:56.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可没法保证质量
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.92,0:35:58.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我几个不怕死的就行
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.28,0:36:00.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么,这回是单程票
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:02.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.32,0:36:07.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,我认识几个不要命的疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.12,0:36:10.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,疯到你自己都想宰了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.12,0:36:12.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,这些家伙怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.84,0:36:13.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.88,0:36:15.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是软脚蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.30,0:36:22.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,(怀俄明州 大提顿山)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.80,0:36:25.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们去见索恩,专业黑客,无人机驾驶员
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.00,0:36:28.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,他花了18个月黑进了西雅图的中央操作系统
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.08,0:36:30.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,让整个城市停转了三天
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.84,0:36:32.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,他干嘛要这么干
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.32,0:36:33.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,就为了证明自己
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.96,0:36:37.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.04,0:36:39.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要坐办公室的人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.84,0:36:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是他
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.84,0:36:44.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个才是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.44,0:36:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他也是个不要命的,你们有很多共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.96,0:36:56.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这我也行
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.40,0:37:06.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道吗,我会跳过来说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.44,0:37:07.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们很配
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.00,0:37:11.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,一、二
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.24,0:37:20.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这你可不行  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.52,0:37:23.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,给个优惠价吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.60,0:37:25.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,是啊,这个有风险
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.76,0:37:31.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好像总是在去,一个我根本就不愿意去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:33.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,总比待着不动好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.60,0:37:36.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我那两个再也不跟我联系的前妻和三个孩子,可不这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.48,0:37:43.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你关闭自动驾驶了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.96,0:37:45.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没碰过那个按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:46.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,把酒给我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.48,0:37:48.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,偏离航线了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:51.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们这是在哪儿啊,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.32,0:37:53.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.64,0:37:56.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,是北斗星吗,我们得掉头了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.96,0:38:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,下个候选人是伪装及近身搏击高手
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.96,0:38:06.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 卢娜  - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.08,0:38:08.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,野丫头,这是我朋友,巴尼·罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:10.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,卢娜,卢娜,这是巴尼·罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:12.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨,你好  - 幸会了,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.48,0:38:14.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生们,跟我来,已经安排好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.00,0:38:16.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,享受一下生活
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.84,0:38:17.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,卢娜,最近怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.00,0:38:19.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,老一套
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.24,0:38:22.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛,想打架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.68,0:38:24.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我失陪一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.48,0:38:27.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来这儿干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.12,0:38:29.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:31.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,候选人在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.72,0:38:34.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,穿红裙子的,正要把那些家伙打趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.20,0:38:39.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个女招待
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:42.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,她不是招待,她是保安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.12,0:39:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这我也能行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.40,0:39:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不你穿上裙子试试
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.88,0:39:11.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,臭男人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.84,0:39:16.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,她很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.40,0:39:17.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你该看看她不穿高跟鞋的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.60,0:39:24.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,(亚利桑那州 阿帕契 交叉口)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.12,0:39:27.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你上次体检是什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:29.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一阵子了,记不清
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.84,0:39:31.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,说你高血脂,动脉硬化
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.56,0:39:32.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对,差不多  - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:37.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是,他们说我的肺里有个肿块
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.80,0:39:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,还说颜色很深
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.44,0:39:41.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,不
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.52,0:39:43.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可真没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.24,0:39:47.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,那打算怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.40,0:39:50.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,在最短的时间里尽可能多赚点钱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.56,0:39:51.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.44,0:39:53.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,留给那几个孩子,虽说都不联系
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.64,0:39:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想死后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.56,0:39:56.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,给他们留点儿好印象
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:39:59.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,很可悲,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.88,0:40:01.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,很可悲,很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.80,0:40:04.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我瞎扯呢,我没病  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.96,0:40:06.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,看你还有没有人性
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:13.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你被我绕进去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.20,0:40:14.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是啊,我都相信了,该死的  - 不错啊,好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.96,0:40:16.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许再忽悠我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.12,0:40:17.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 否则我不相信你了  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.72,0:40:19.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来这孩子是匹黑马
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.40,0:40:21.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的资料刚送来不久
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.96,0:40:23.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢发什么外卡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.08,0:40:26.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,可他条件太优秀,错过可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.40,0:40:28.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁看到费利佩了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.56,0:40:32.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,费利佩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.80,0:40:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的身手真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.36,0:40:43.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,还行
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.92,0:40:45.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你总算会挑人了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.64,0:40:52.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.72,0:41:00.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,费利佩·席尔瓦,见见巴尼·罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.32,0:41:07.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,高格,你是不是又发了一份假的简历给我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.52,0:41:10.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗斯先生,你要我做什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.36,0:41:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,做什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.52,0:41:13.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我比看上去要健康
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.68,0:41:14.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,比看上去要强壮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.76,0:41:15.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,速度要更快
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.84,0:41:17.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,见鬼,你难道是84年出生的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:18.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.84,0:41:20.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我感觉自己就像是84年生的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.84,0:41:22.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你别浪费时间了,巴尼,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.60,0:41:23.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.68,0:41:24.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗斯先生,罗斯先生,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.96,0:41:26.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.36,0:41:29.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就像是,就像是找到了青春泉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.92,0:41:33.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说,不是那个青春泉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.60,0:41:35.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,而是那个庞塞·德·莱昂找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.96,0:41:39.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,顺带说一句,他可是,和我一样,都是西班牙人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.04,0:41:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,先生,罗斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.56,0:41:45.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,年龄,只是一种心态
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.44,0:41:50.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有当你投降,当你放弃时,才会真的变老
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.12,0:41:51.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,而我现在
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.32,0:41:53.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,还没有投降
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.16,0:41:54.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 高格,别再这样  - 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.68,0:41:56.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了,这是这个月第三次了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.72,0:41:57.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,说真的,去干点别的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.24,0:42:00.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这家伙什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.24,0:42:02.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,老实说,我挺同情他,原来的团队不要他了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.92,0:42:06.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,放在过去,没人追得上他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.16,0:42:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他非常快,也许比你还快  - 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:12.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,有可能,可我能怎么说呢,这是年轻人的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.80,0:42:15.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要工作
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.08,0:42:19.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我唯一会干的事就是杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.52,0:42:24.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且我干得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.85,0:42:33.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,(加州 爱德华空军基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.60,0:42:34.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,这家伙有什么经历?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.76,0:42:36.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我在达帕找到的  - 达帕
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.64,0:42:39.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,听上去像个北非的城镇
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.48,0:42:41.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实是国防高级研究计划局
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.08,0:42:45.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们召集了最聪明的军事天才开发新式武器
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.00,0:42:47.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你用得着他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.60,0:42:49.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不需要书呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.56,0:42:52.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你算来对地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.68,0:42:57.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,马尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.76,0:43:07.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,马尔斯,这是巴尼·罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.60,0:43:09.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,枪炮到了马尔斯手上,就像遇到了知音
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.00,0:43:11.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.92,0:43:12.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.00,0:43:16.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是把XM25突击步枪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.40,0:43:18.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,激光测距,25毫米烈性空爆弹
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.60,0:43:21.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,能编程让它在目标前面或者后面爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.20,0:43:32.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.80,0:43:38.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后一位候选人,约翰·斯麦利
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.12,0:43:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这家伙有这条街上最多的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.40,0:43:44.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,掌握各种技能,当过海军陆战队特种兵,就是,有一个缺点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.52,0:43:45.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么缺点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯,老一套,目无领导
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.16,0:43:53.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里面的好苗子还挺多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:26.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,巴尼,浪费你的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.08,0:44:27.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我看错了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.24,0:44:28.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:30.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想见见他
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.00,0:44:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰,来见见巴尼·罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.92,0:44:45.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你今天的表现好像不够抢眼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.28,0:44:47.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你自己来找我的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.52,0:44:49.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了钱故意放水
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:54.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是你喜欢被人打得满地找牙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.24,0:45:05.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们找我干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.24,0:45:09.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是在逃避吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.40,0:45:10.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.72,0:45:11.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.76,0:45:12.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是吗  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.92,0:45:14.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.08,0:45:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,他觉得你有潜质,而我们又在赶时间
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.60,0:45:16.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,是这意思吗,就这意思
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.00,0:45:18.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是你的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.08,0:45:19.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.12,0:45:22.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了那点可怜巴巴的小钱儿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.60,0:45:24.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,就满地打滚
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:27.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说你在沙漠失去了一些朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.68,0:45:30.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们死了,你没死,你感到很愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.64,0:45:34.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你一样,他也是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.08,0:45:36.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们接受现实了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.24,0:45:39.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.04,0:45:41.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我了解你这类型
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.36,0:45:52.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,波拿巴,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.00,0:45:55.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是在浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.60,0:46:08.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没有浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.60,0:46:28.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然你的目标是斯通班克斯,那我们就得谈谈酬金了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.52,0:46:31.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,一般只要先付10%,可考虑到
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.68,0:46:33.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的对手是斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.56,0:46:37.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在就得拿到,全部的费用
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.84,0:46:39.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.20,0:46:40.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是说你不行
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.00,0:46:42.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是,希望你别介意
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.32,0:46:44.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.52,0:46:47.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好像对我没什么信心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.08,0:46:49.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.76,0:47:19.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,假度得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.84,0:47:21.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备工作了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.32,0:47:22.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你找到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.88,0:47:26.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在布加勒斯特,跟一帮阿尔巴尼亚人谈交易
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.40,0:47:28.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有36个小时,这是你唯一的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.84,0:47:30.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后,他会消失得无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.36,0:47:34.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是卫星地图,上面有他位置的坐标
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.52,0:47:40.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的这位朋友,是个很有意思的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.20,0:47:42.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可能不情愿,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.00,0:47:44.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,上面要求抓活的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.76,0:47:46.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是在耍我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.64,0:47:48.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们想在海牙国际法庭
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.56,0:47:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,因战争罪起诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.12,0:47:54.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你居然想给他上法庭的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.16,0:47:55.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,又不是我要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.60,0:47:59.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,从来都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.40,0:48:01.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 上面定了,只能照办  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.16,0:48:07.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的机构在当地有个安全屋,你会用得着
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.48,0:48:10.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,别搞得太乱
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.52,0:48:58.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 听说你有任务了  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.36,0:49:01.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些家伙是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:02.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.12,0:49:07.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.52,0:49:10.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,宫纳,该说的我在酒吧里都跟你说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.12,0:49:11.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,别喝那么多酒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.88,0:49:16.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,带着那帮毛头小子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.40,0:49:20.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是想找死啊,为了大家好,赶快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.28,0:49:24.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,10点钟出发
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.72,0:49:28.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧去,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.56,0:49:38.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你那些兄弟想吵架,还不如找人结婚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.64,0:49:42.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是真心要在航空燃油边上抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.76,0:49:50.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,真业余
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.56,0:49:53.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,是个业余混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.00,0:49:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫谁混蛋呢,老爹
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.60,0:49:58.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,老爹是要把你的气管捏碎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.48,0:50:03.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么,你的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.32,0:50:05.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.92,0:50:07.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 想跳舞,傻大个儿  - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.92,0:50:11.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是来干活的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.48,0:50:14.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,行了,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.44,0:50:18.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,过气的老东西还装什么强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.16,0:50:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你个年轻的脑残
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.20,0:50:31.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,叮叮当,叮叮当
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.40,0:50:37.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,留着吧,用的上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.44,0:50:50.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,没想到你会请我来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.92,0:50:52.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,别太得意忘形
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.92,0:51:25.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,介意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.68,0:51:29.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你少操那份心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.20,0:51:32.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不如来讨论下任务吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.80,0:51:34.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,有谁知道这个通班克斯?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.76,0:51:38.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,通班克斯曾是SASR
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.56,0:51:44.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 澳大利亚特种空勤团  - 就这些?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.96,0:51:46.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 已经比你俩知道的多了  - 真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.48,0:51:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们两个废材
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.48,0:51:50.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,要我说啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:54.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们还不如直接脱裤子亮腚放屁?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.00,0:52:14.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,想聊聊吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.52,0:52:18.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.16,0:52:21.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我说说要抓的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.88,0:52:24.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,没必要,你是来干活的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.24,0:52:28.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,那能不能告诉我,为什么要干这活儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.68,0:52:34.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我要付你工资
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.28,0:52:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么要抓斯通班克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.76,0:52:42.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,要你听我的命令很费劲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.08,0:52:45.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的命令不明确
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.00,0:52:52.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你不把我们,放在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.84,0:52:56.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,可你得告诉我,为什么这么想抓那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.32,0:54:57.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,离跳伞还有30秒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.96,0:54:58.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.56,0:55:01.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.48,0:55:07.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我自己能行
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.96,0:55:10.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有20秒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.76,0:55:15.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有10秒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.76,0:55:41.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,(罗马尼亚 布加勒斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.64,0:56:16.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,行动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.80,0:56:29.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,这家伙的保镖比世界首富还多
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.72,0:56:31.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,大概是要弥补什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.40,0:56:32.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在下面干嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.48,0:56:33.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,在喝香草拿铁
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.56,0:56:34.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,保持警惕
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.64,0:56:35.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,卢娜,上
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.12,0:56:38.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我不会再忍下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.96,0:56:41.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果再发生这种情况的话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.44,0:56:43.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 车过来  - 我跟你说话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.44,0:57:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.68,0:57:06.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,车技真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.96,0:57:10.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,演技不错,是啊,好过头了,再近一点儿,我揍扁他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.32,0:57:11.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,这我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.68,0:57:12.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.20,0:57:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,天呐,这家伙保护得比总统还好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.40,0:57:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,他的老窝跟五星级堡垒似的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.20,0:57:26.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以不能在那儿动手
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.52,0:57:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,酒店里又都是客人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.44,0:57:31.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那怎么办  - 会面的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.92,0:57:34.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们从四面发动进攻,狠狠地打
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.88,0:57:39.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,那么,我们的计划是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.04,0:57:41.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,把门踹开,然后开枪一顿狂扫
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.84,0:57:44.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,要在85年,这是个好计划
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.28,0:57:46.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.88,0:57:48.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.32,0:57:54.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你有更好主意吗  - 多的是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.36,0:57:55.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,说来听听
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.76,0:57:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,索恩,你说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.04,0:58:00.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,有个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.72,0:58:03.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,但愿是好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.92,0:58:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,先黑进安保系统的主服务器,嘣
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.84,0:58:09.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,绕开运动探测器的激光和生物监察
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.24,0:58:12.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,啪,然后重写监控视频和闭路电视监控系统
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.00,0:58:15.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,叭嘣,我们进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.56,0:58:17.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯麦利想出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.92,0:58:20.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就这么简单  - 就这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.36,0:58:22.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.04,0:58:24.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这么,简单
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.64,0:58:31.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,但愿行得通
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.96,0:58:35.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,行动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.36,0:59:06.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛解散原来的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.72,0:59:11.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这行待久了就会理解,应该解散
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.40,0:59:14.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们好像不情愿呐
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.96,0:59:16.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你也想把团队当成家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.20,0:59:22.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,那这工作不适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.16,0:59:25.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,家庭有各种各样的形式
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.88,0:59:29.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我身处险境的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.48,0:59:31.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,家人会和我并肩作战
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.32,0:59:39.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.52,0:59:42.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,我懂你意思
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.20,0:59:51.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,(布加勒斯特现代艺术馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.63,0:59:58.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,时间正好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.60,1:00:04.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士优先
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.68,1:00:06.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你先走啊,索恩
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.12,1:00:07.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴,快下去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.28,1:00:54.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.86,1:00:56.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,(启动)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.14,1:01:24.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们,现在我们在空中有眼线了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.28,1:01:25.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到了,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.96,1:01:27.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,可算开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.80,1:02:10.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.80,1:02:12.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.44,1:02:34.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.24,1:02:35.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.60,1:02:37.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,是买家,早到了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.56,1:02:38.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,危险加倍
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.04,1:02:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来早了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.36,1:02:58.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.20,1:03:01.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不错
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.40,1:03:12.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,该隐杀了自己的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.80,1:03:14.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝把他逐出了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.00,1:03:16.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,文明世界
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.68,1:03:18.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,在那之前,他给该隐做了个记号
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.20,1:03:22.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,这记号不是为了说明他是罪人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.40,1:03:25.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,而是为了保护他不被猎人杀死
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.80,1:03:30.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,海关不会用X光检查艺术品
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.08,1:03:31.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,会破坏颜料
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.52,1:03:32.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.44,1:03:36.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,归你了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.08,1:03:40.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 不必客气
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.56,1:03:47.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能搞到,核武器吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.24,1:03:53.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.28,1:03:58.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过,我发现人在这个东西的,所有权问题上容易冲动
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.76,1:04:00.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不希望你有意无意地,把我其他客户
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.12,1:04:03.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,都弄死了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.68,1:04:06.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已就位
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.32,1:04:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,就位
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.48,1:04:11.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,就位
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.76,1:04:13.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要多少钱都行
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.48,1:04:15.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.20,1:04:37.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,注意,斯通班克斯在移动
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.32,1:04:43.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢小耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.49,1:04:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,再试一次
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.80,1:04:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,芝麻开门
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.48,1:04:59.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,走,走,走,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.56,1:05:10.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,(接受重写 重载安全门锁)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.31,1:05:13.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,卢娜,上
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:19.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼向你问好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.16,1:05:28.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.72,1:05:32.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,战壕,收到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.68,1:05:35.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我等着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.92,1:05:37.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,货搞定了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.36,1:05:39.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,动作快一点,等得无聊死了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.32,1:05:52.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不给他一枪,一了百了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.12,1:06:04.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,你说过我们要带他走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.52,1:06:08.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.80,1:06:14.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些是你的学生
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.76,1:06:18.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们,今天学到了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.52,1:06:19.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,那帮老家伙们去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.00,1:06:22.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.72,1:06:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,那帮老家伙去管别人的闲事
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.16,1:06:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果死的死伤的伤
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.96,1:06:28.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在他们成了已死队了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.16,1:06:31.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,记住我说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.52,1:06:33.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们也在走这条路
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.24,1:06:35.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,能让他闭嘴吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.48,1:06:38.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,对一个丧失行动能力的人说话这么凶,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.68,1:06:40.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.60,1:06:42.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,不如给我松绑,我把你的心挖出来给你看看
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.28,1:06:46.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说巴尼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.92,1:06:49.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们两个做个了断吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.92,1:06:52.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说呢,狠狠干一仗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.44,1:06:55.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,要么你折断我的脊椎,要么你折断我的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.52,1:06:56.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样,来个痛快的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:07:00.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你当我开玩笑,我可没有
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.20,1:07:02.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你该看看我发飙的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.24,1:07:04.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你绝对会印象深刻,然后就死了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.00,1:07:10.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,老兄,想说什么就说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.76,1:07:15.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿,说出来,我洗耳恭听
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.04,1:07:20.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是想把我带回到那些老队员面前
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.36,1:07:23.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,围着篝火把我撕碎,就像原始部落
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.84,1:07:27.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我到了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.24,1:07:31.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会把你身上所有的骨头都打断
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.56,1:07:34.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,把剩下的交给海牙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.20,1:07:37.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,海牙国际法庭
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.52,1:07:40.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这回终于搞大了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.32,1:07:41.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是战犯了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.92,1:07:43.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就笑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.88,1:07:50.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为,你能把我当个货物,运过去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.04,1:07:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们以前多亲密
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.12,1:08:00.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,最早是我们一起组建的敢死队
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.60,1:08:02.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧,我这儿还有记号呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.84,1:08:06.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,好像有点儿褪色了,后来我们闹翻了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.68,1:08:08.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你走上黑道了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.96,1:08:10.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是个黑暗的营生
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.20,1:08:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,别装得好像你没干过
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.24,1:08:15.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,最坏的人才能活下来,这我可没瞎说
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.96,1:08:20.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼为了一丁点儿小钱,就愿意给人家打工卖命
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.20,1:08:22.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,当老板要赚的钱多得多
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.68,1:08:24.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过这事你不会懂的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.52,1:08:27.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,另外你还有讨厌的良心
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.04,1:08:30.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿最碍事了,他老把自己当好人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.00,1:08:32.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 趁你还能说话就说吧  - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.08,1:08:34.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,有良心你就会变得软弱
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.40,1:08:36.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,成功,真正的成功
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.68,1:08:40.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,是愿意去做别人都不愿意做的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.60,1:08:42.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是所有人都跟你一样恶心
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.12,1:08:44.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,不过你是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.16,1:08:47.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天你杀人了吗,炸了什么地方吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.32,1:08:51.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们,你们杀人了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.84,1:08:55.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,在海牙国际法庭审判我之前
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.52,1:08:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们也许该看看自己身上有没有沾着血
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.84,1:09:03.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,我跑题了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.52,1:09:05.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了,生意很红火
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.28,1:09:08.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿卖架直升机,那儿卖颗导弹,还有那些枪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.68,1:09:13.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后,突然一个竞争对手,我把山姆大叔叫做竞争对手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.68,1:09:17.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,雇了我自己的团队
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.56,1:09:19.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼和所有队里的人来对付我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.06,1:09:20.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后事情急转直下,好多人都死了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.64,1:09:22.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,三个亲如兄弟的战友
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.36,1:09:23.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭上你臭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.48,1:09:25.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,三个敢死队员
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.08,1:09:27.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是好兄弟,我们一起吃饭
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.48,1:09:30.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起战斗,一起流血,都死了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.20,1:09:32.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他朝我胸口开了三枪,多亏我穿了防弹衣
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.04,1:09:34.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,当时我都以为自己死了,可他跟个没事儿人一样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.00,1:09:37.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟们都死了,就因为你非要干涉我的生意
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.04,1:09:40.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.08,1:09:41.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀,动手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.68,1:09:43.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 开枪啊  - 你想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.04,1:10:01.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是没想到,不敢相信你居然忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.64,1:10:02.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.92,1:10:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你很难把一个,你一直放在心里的人当成敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.80,1:10:10.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把我像牲口一样的绑起来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.36,1:10:14.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,送到屠夫面前,你羞辱我,贬低我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.36,1:10:16.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果以后我有机会,一定会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.52,1:10:19.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会用武器,我会用手
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.88,1:10:22.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我要让你体会我现在的感受
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.12,1:10:28.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾经是兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.80,1:10:34.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.16,1:10:36.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,GPS追踪器,他有GPS追踪器
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.60,1:10:38.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.28,1:12:00.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.80,1:12:05.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们还有用,把巴尼的尸体找来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.96,1:13:30.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.64,1:13:32.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,阴沟里翻船
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.16,1:13:35.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,还会更糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.28,1:13:38.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,10分钟之前发给你的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.60,1:13:43.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.36,1:13:46.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的搜索队都死光了,所以我想你应该还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.48,1:13:48.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你当时真该杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.28,1:13:50.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是你唯一的机会,现在没了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.64,1:13:52.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,我有点儿东西给你看
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.64,1:13:56.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有哈珀,格鲁乔
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.20,1:13:58.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,伽莫,还有琦科尔,耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.20,1:14:02.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,克鲁格,抱抱她
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.20,1:14:04.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可是个大美女啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.80,1:14:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我来说,弄死几个无辜的倒霉蛋不算什么
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.32,1:14:11.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过,我了解你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.48,1:14:13.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,48小时之后,他们就真完了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.04,1:14:17.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,想救他们,你就来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.36,1:14:19.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.12,1:14:51.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,绳子勒得挺紧的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.04,1:14:55.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是你们在巴尼的道德棋局里当小兵的结果
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.20,1:14:58.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个看上去有点儿松
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.08,1:15:06.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我最替你感到惋惜
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.28,1:15:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才不管你怎么想呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.20,1:15:12.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的,我有个女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.48,1:15:14.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也有感情,无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.64,1:15:16.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,当中情局,我假设你们为中情局干活儿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.88,1:15:18.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,中情局,我猜得对吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.32,1:15:22.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不会连自己为谁干都不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.28,1:15:26.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,为巴尼吗,你们知道他为谁干吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.64,1:15:31.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,他知道自己为谁干吗,越扯越乱了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.20,1:15:33.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正当中情局要找人去危险的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.92,1:15:37.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,干那些危险的活儿,会找我们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.12,1:15:40.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,当他们不想脏了自己的手,会找我们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.68,1:15:44.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,我们帮他们清理所有让他们头疼的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.44,1:15:49.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们把坏蛋赶跑,让这些好人能过来装英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.08,1:15:55.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们杀了很多人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.60,1:16:00.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们拯救的生命多得超乎你们的想象
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.92,1:16:06.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后,那些家伙们就想过河拆桥杀人灭口
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.80,1:16:09.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们想做掉我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.96,1:16:11.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以前是美国人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.52,1:16:13.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,为美国这国家卖命
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.36,1:16:15.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,以前是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.28,1:16:18.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们连自己的孩子都吃
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.60,1:16:22.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,教训就是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.28,1:16:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,千万不要跟政府做生意
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.20,1:16:32.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是别抱幻想了,他不会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.00,1:16:47.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要召回老队员
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.32,1:16:49.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我不会找他们的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.12,1:16:50.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的自尊心会害死你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.80,1:16:52.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我死总比他们死好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.08,1:16:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真的要回去救人  - 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.24,1:16:56.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一个人去  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.20,1:16:58.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.00,1:17:00.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.64,1:17:03.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这忙已经帮完了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.60,1:17:09.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.12,1:17:38.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.00,1:17:42.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个嘛,没有不透风的墙,我又比较会打听
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.88,1:17:45.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有个任务,我能帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.04,1:17:48.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫,高格
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.76,1:17:50.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你介绍一下,我很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.36,1:17:53.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,打起仗来,非常棒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.60,1:17:55.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,记忆力超强,什么也不怕
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.84,1:17:58.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想成为你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.00,1:18:00.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不需要朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.76,1:18:04.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要,谁都需要朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.72,1:18:08.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,我一个朋友也没有,我知道朋友有多重要
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.96,1:18:14.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过除了交朋友之外,我现在最需要的是找点事情做
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.08,1:18:19.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是随便找点事情做,而是要做我最擅长的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.60,1:18:21.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,那太糟了,这是单程车
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.28,1:18:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.16,1:18:27.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐单程车,总比没车坐好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.00,1:18:29.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在是什么车都没得坐
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.64,1:18:37.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮我搬箱子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.60,1:18:41.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.96,1:18:45.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,搬飞机上,格格
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.48,1:18:46.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,搬飞机上,是
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.00,1:18:49.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫我格格,不,我不叫格格
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.44,1:18:51.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我叫高格,格格像巴黎妓女的名字  - 高格
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.88,1:19:07.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我,是死神的新郎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.96,1:19:10.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是西班牙军团一首老歌的歌词
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.80,1:19:12.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在克罗地亚执行任务的时候经常唱
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.00,1:19:15.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是那里认识的明格
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.84,1:19:18.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,他是有史以来最棒的侦察兵
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.32,1:19:21.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他就像是这方面的专家
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.64,1:19:23.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有他发现不了的埋伏
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.68,1:19:25.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,遭到攻击的时候他最镇定
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.60,1:19:27.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管什么情况都脸不改色心不跳
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.04,1:19:30.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一次我们寡不敌众,就剩两颗子弹了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.20,1:19:34.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看他,连汗都不带出的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.72,1:19:36.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是太酷了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.16,1:19:42.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,帅,要我帮你吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.84,1:19:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还是机修工
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.20,1:19:46.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我当然是机修工,你要我是什么,我就是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.92,1:19:48.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,我要你闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.00,1:19:50.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯,是,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.04,1:19:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,老虎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.65,1:19:54.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认识的一个狙击手,把狙击研究得透透的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.80,1:19:56.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么风速啊,温度啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.60,1:19:59.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有什么气压之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.24,1:20:01.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道他说什么才是最重要的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.08,1:20:03.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不知道  - 耐心
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.68,1:20:06.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真的  - 真的,他这么说的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.04,1:20:10.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿是什么,真好闻,煤油吗,汽油吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.48,1:20:11.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.52,1:20:13.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 航空燃油  - 原来是航空燃油
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.36,1:20:16.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好闻
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.68,1:20:20.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,有史以来最棒的队员
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.72,1:20:23.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的名字叫托雷斯,我的天呐
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.24,1:20:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,那家伙什么都会,无所不能
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.72,1:20:29.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,简直不可思议,我跟你说
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.24,1:20:30.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 高格  - 是,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.56,1:20:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你的团队为什么不要你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.72,1:20:36.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.12,1:20:41.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.72,1:20:53.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,好大的飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.40,1:20:57.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然够老,但酷得很
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.56,1:20:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 其他人在哪里?  - 只有我们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.88,1:21:01.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就我们?  - 就我们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.96,1:21:03.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.20,1:21:05.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,勇气可嘉,但还是疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.44,1:21:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后问你一次
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.00,1:21:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的要跟我去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.04,1:21:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢旅行
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.36,1:21:12.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.52,1:21:37.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些人是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.24,1:21:38.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的老队员
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.64,1:21:51.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们来这儿干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.88,1:21:54.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有你这种笨蛋会蠢到会趟这浑水
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.88,1:21:58.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,也只有我们会疯到去把你拉出来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.72,1:22:03.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,快上来,打仗要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.32,1:22:13.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,高格,你还是别坐这个位子了,圣诞到了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.84,1:22:15.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,可现在才六月份
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.88,1:22:17.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,高格,快给我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.72,1:22:23.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,长官,我拿一下,我的帽子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.76,1:22:32.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我很好奇  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.08,1:22:34.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始把自杀当爱好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.28,1:22:35.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我立了份遗嘱
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.28,1:22:38.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我大概是你现在唯一的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.68,1:22:39.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我朋友多着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.96,1:22:41.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,只要你一出现,大家都欢呼雀跃
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.24,1:22:45.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真想你,圣诞
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.04,1:22:48.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也想你,你这个疯狂的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.48,1:22:50.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以把疯狂两个字去掉
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.56,1:22:56.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样一种坚固的固体结构,在以难以置信的速度
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.64,1:22:58.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,把我们从一个地方带到另一个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.20,1:23:00.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好想想
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.12,1:23:02.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果,如果,如果上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.04,1:23:06.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望我们飞翔,他会让我们身上长翅膀
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.28,1:23:07.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有翅膀吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.44,1:23:08.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有翅膀吗,你有翅膀吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.64,1:23:09.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有翅膀
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.80,1:23:12.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次飞行会很漫长
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.12,1:23:14.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯定会是一次,会是一次漫长的飞行
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.92,1:23:18.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,有我呢,我在飞机上,一向睡不着
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.92,1:23:20.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.00,1:23:22.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望你知道,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.44,1:23:23.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在往屎坑里跳
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.96,1:23:27.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,国家安全局搜索了你那些被抓队员的手机信号
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.80,1:23:29.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,那混蛋都没想把他们藏起来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.96,1:23:32.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们在哪儿  - 他们在阿兹门尼斯坦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.36,1:23:33.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,又是个度蜜月的好地方
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.08,1:23:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁在说话
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.28,1:23:36.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,李·圣诞
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.76,1:23:38.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,离圣诞是不远了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.64,1:23:41.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯通班克斯在那儿训练手下的雇佣兵
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.84,1:23:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,那里的防守非常严密
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.68,1:23:45.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,当地的军队怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.16,1:23:47.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,这家伙说的话我一句也没听懂
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.40,1:23:48.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,他问当地军队的情况
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.12,1:23:51.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,小军队,很腐败
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.20,1:23:53.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,斯通班克斯的口袋里有的是钱
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.48,1:23:56.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,他已经在那个该死的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.16,1:23:57.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,随心所欲好几年了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.16,1:24:00.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 想听建议吗  - 你的建议是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.32,1:24:02.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,那家伙说的是什么鸟语
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.52,1:24:04.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也听不懂你想说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.60,1:24:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有脸说我
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.68,1:24:07.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有什么建议
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.16,1:24:09.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,忘掉个人恩怨吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.16,1:24:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,记住我们的约定,我们要抓活的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.16,1:24:12.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,好让他在法庭上
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.68,1:24:14.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,钻法律的空子解脱罪行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.40,1:24:16.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可是命令,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.72,1:24:19.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对讲机砸坏了  - 还有一个呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.52,1:24:23.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次我们能活着回去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.00,1:24:26.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没必要跟我一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.40,1:24:28.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然有必要
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.72,1:24:31.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,笨蛋需要有人罩着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.68,1:24:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生们,计划改变了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.12,1:24:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,就你们俩,这就是你的救援队
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.88,1:25:00.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,时间仓促嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.04,1:25:03.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,长得也够仓促
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.08,1:25:06.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的团队呢,鼓手少校
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.32,1:25:08.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有团队,这次是私人行动
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.72,1:25:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我根本没来过这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.56,1:25:13.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,没有人来过这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.32,1:25:17.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来以为,就教堂是流氓
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.92,1:25:22.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界上仅剩的军队
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.28,1:25:26.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们,我提到过佩皮托吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.00,1:25:29.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,人小志气大
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.00,1:25:33.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看到过他手撕壮汉对半开
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.60,1:25:35.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱那个刺青
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.68,1:25:38.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这种类型,你那上面刻的黑鸡叫什么名字?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.16,1:25:42.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌鸦,配骷髅头的乌鸦,我喜欢这么干...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.76,1:25:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,他们把这叫做精神力量,多奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.16,1:25:50.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,长官,奇怪的概念
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.68,1:25:54.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果一个人他有很强的精神力量,都不用去健身房锻炼了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.80,1:25:57.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你天生就强,你就是强,你就是强
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.76,1:25:59.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过这个词在19世纪,其实
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.88,1:26:02.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实是被用来表示女人的歇斯底里症
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.24,1:26:06.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,当时这是一个病理概念,知道什么意思吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.76,1:26:08.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,这地方真有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.04,1:26:11.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他让我偏头痛  - 可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.72,1:26:13.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样?,冷得要死
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.68,1:26:14.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,往好了看
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.04,1:26:17.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,万一没弹药了,他能把敌人说死
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.32,1:26:18.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.72,1:26:20.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,高个子不喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.92,1:26:22.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他不喜欢任何人  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.60,1:26:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么  - 他喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.76,1:26:35.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.92,1:26:39.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 你手上绑的是电脑
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.20,1:26:41.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.28,1:26:43.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你上回嘲笑那孩子用的玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.76,1:26:45.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我用了一阵儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.28,1:26:57.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的团队为什么不要你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.88,1:27:03.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,问这个干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.12,1:27:05.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想了解我的同事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.28,1:27:10.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们,他们都已经不在了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.60,1:27:17.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么,当初
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.72,1:27:23.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会扔下你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.64,1:27:25.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有扔下我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.08,1:27:36.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,在班加西
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.28,1:27:40.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,那时候我已经退役了,我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.72,1:27:44.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,去解救一个人质,有点儿像
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.80,1:27:48.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.80,1:27:53.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后,那天天气很好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.96,1:27:56.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.68,1:27:59.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后情况突然变糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.36,1:28:03.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们遭到了袭击,没退路了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.28,1:28:06.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,等待支援,没有人来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.44,1:28:09.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,后来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.12,1:28:14.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人都死了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.00,1:28:19.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,只剩下了我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.84,1:28:21.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,明格,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.12,1:28:24.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,托雷斯,还有老虎
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.80,1:28:30.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.00,1:28:32.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,我听着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.52,1:28:36.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.48,1:29:16.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么想
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.08,1:29:21.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们过去做个了断吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.78,1:29:51.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,四个人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.80,1:29:53.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,在第八层
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.28,1:29:57.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这很不正常,我感觉不对劲
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.04,1:29:59.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他肯定在盯着我们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.08,1:30:01.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能提一个小建议吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.76,1:30:03.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,现在不行
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.72,1:30:06.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,就知道会这样,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.00,1:31:13.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.88,1:31:45.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,弄开它
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.36,1:31:53.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.80,1:31:54.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.08,1:31:59.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.68,1:32:03.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.00,1:32:06.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过有人能来接这些孩子也好
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.64,1:32:07.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你找到他们了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.68,1:32:10.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,想办法带他们出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.24,1:32:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,可不幸的是
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.08,1:32:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,整栋大楼都装上了C4炸药
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.68,1:32:19.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,一般人用90秒就能从里面出来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.04,1:32:21.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,至于你嘛,45秒够吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.06,1:32:25.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,(引爆倒计时)
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.41,1:32:37.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,他把这儿变成了个大炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.71,1:32:41.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来试试
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.28,1:32:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,只剩9%,你没充电吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.36,1:32:51.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思,你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.56,1:32:52.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,运行某些代码,应该能干扰信号
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.92,1:32:55.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么没想到
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.12,1:32:56.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只用它看天气
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.36,1:32:58.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们能不能闭嘴,别干扰他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.12,1:32:59.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能行吗,索恩
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.52,1:33:00.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能行,我能行
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.80,1:33:06.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,别着急,别着急
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.16,1:33:08.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,快啊,伙计,加油,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.56,1:33:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,加油,伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.00,1:33:11.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快点儿  - 快点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.56,1:33:13.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,加油,快点儿,索恩,快点儿,索恩
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.16,1:33:15.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,别着急
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.44,1:33:18.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 打开开关  - 你能行的,加油,索恩
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.16,1:33:20.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿,快点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.48,1:33:21.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静,安静
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.28,1:33:24.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞定
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.96,1:33:26.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,太棒了,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.52,1:33:33.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能重写了,信号被干扰了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.76,1:33:35.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫他们来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.74,1:33:41.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,电量还剩8%,一旦没电就无法干扰了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.48,1:33:43.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样我们最多有25分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.18,1:33:49.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有麻烦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.85,1:33:50.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 而且是大麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.68,1:34:05.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,运气不错
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.80,1:34:07.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,趁现在好好欣赏风景吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.48,1:34:09.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,很快你们所在的这栋大楼,它就会
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.00,1:34:12.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,就会被阿兹门尼斯坦的军队包围了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.68,1:34:14.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.80,1:34:16.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是你们这群白痴惹的祸
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.68,1:34:17.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.92,1:34:25.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,都退后
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.20,1:34:28.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是意外
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.36,1:34:30.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被困在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.16,1:34:33.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很清楚,会发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.36,1:34:36.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,他想,让我们自相残杀
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.76,1:34:39.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不能这样
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.56,1:34:41.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能逃出去
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.36,1:34:43.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我们必须要
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.40,1:34:45.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,齐心协力
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.84,1:34:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们相互配合
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.40,1:34:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就有希望活着离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.60,1:34:57.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们想活着离开吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.52,1:34:59.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,很简单
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.40,1:35:01.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有武器吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.56,1:35:04.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,计划是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.60,1:35:05.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们分成几个小组,从底楼冲出去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.00,1:35:07.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.24,1:35:08.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.88,1:35:35.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 索恩,你跟我一组,你带高格  - 我才不要呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.64,1:36:01.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,别停下,一个去那儿,一个去那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.44,1:36:18.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们人太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.08,1:36:21.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们在侧面,快去干掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.08,1:36:23.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,干掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.88,1:36:42.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了,炸死他们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.12,1:36:50.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,炮弹来了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.84,1:37:03.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,索恩,你去电梯井,保护好信号干扰器
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.20,1:37:22.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,侧面掩护,快
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.28,1:38:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,天呐,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.80,1:38:15.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.04,1:38:19.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,可爽了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.24,1:38:22.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,浑身是劲,我们现在是兄弟了!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.88,1:38:24.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好,继续前进
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.76,1:38:25.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,长官!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.00,1:39:15.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,放松点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.00,1:39:17.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说了,你老这样容易中风
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.16,1:39:19.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,鼓手
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.24,1:39:20.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计,有坦克找你麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.00,1:39:22.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.56,1:39:23.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正想呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.16,1:39:27.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,战壕,注意右边
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.32,1:39:36.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定很疼
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.68,1:39:42.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我请客,吃炮弹
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.28,1:40:01.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,快看
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.04,1:40:08.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.52,1:40:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们,该加快速度了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.24,1:40:28.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心后面直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.48,1:41:19.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.12,1:41:20.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.16,1:41:49.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样,干你的活儿去
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.88,1:41:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.60,1:42:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.56,1:42:12.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,近点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.44,1:42:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,再近点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.32,1:42:20.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,阴阳,快给我打
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.04,1:42:28.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.68,1:42:39.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫卢娜,对吗,卢娜的意思是月亮
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.96,1:42:44.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,充满梦幻,充满神秘,又神奇,就像你
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.56,1:42:50.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能拿着我的家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.48,1:43:20.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去拿你的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.48,1:43:24.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,开起来
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.48,1:43:31.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是为了凯撒,混蛋们
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.96,1:43:35.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 耶  - 喔,太爽了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.56,1:44:23.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,都在我掌握之中
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.56,1:44:25.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,看上去是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.84,1:44:45.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.60,1:46:33.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我这辈子最开心的时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.80,1:46:56.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,叮叮当,叮叮当
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.92,1:47:14.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞定了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.20,1:47:40.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,臭男人
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.48,1:47:44.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你一定不会相信的  - 噢,天呐
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.20,1:47:46.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我脑子里一直都在想着你
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.16,1:47:47.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真能打  - 能走了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.56,1:47:52.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.12,1:47:55.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.64,1:48:00.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿学的开飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.36,1:48:01.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,该你上了,战壕
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.96,1:48:17.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼,增援部队来了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.92,1:48:28.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.20,1:48:38.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,鼓手,他们又来了一拨
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.12,1:48:40.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,只能从上面出去了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.84,1:48:43.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我马上到,5秒钟后撤离
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.68,1:48:44.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.76,1:48:46.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人上屋顶,快
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.84,1:48:47.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.76,1:48:57.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,战壕,阴阳,快去清理屋顶
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.08,1:48:58.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.44,1:49:56.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.48,1:49:58.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,每次都这么容易,差不多
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.56,1:50:00.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀十个人有那么难吗,至少打伤几个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.64,1:50:01.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我瞧着
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.36,1:50:03.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.72,1:50:05.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,都会了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.32,1:50:07.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,没用的废物
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.40,1:50:12.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,还得我亲自出马
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.64,1:50:34.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有人代客泊车吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.52,1:50:37.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,那边有几个
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.28,1:50:39.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,走,走,走
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.28,1:51:02.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,别停下
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.64,1:51:04.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,快,伙计们,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.60,1:51:28.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,鼓手,火力太猛
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.08,1:51:29.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,别叽里咕噜的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.12,1:51:34.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.88,1:51:36.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们上直升机吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.40,1:51:37.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.72,1:51:39.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,走,走,走,走,走,快点儿,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.84,1:51:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,快,我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.72,1:51:48.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 阴阳  - 不用谢
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.36,1:51:49.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在为战壕工作
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.80,1:51:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,他开的工资高
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.76,1:51:54.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你他妈是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.04,1:51:56.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚刚救了你命的人
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.60,1:52:01.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,电量还剩2%
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.44,1:52:08.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,巴尼,这么快就走吗
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.60,1:52:10.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们做个了断吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.76,1:52:17.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.08,1:52:25.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,站起来,会感觉好点儿
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.80,1:52:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼,你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.84,1:52:40.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,把防弹衣脱了,我让你好好感受感受
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.24,1:52:42.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼,我们得撤了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.76,1:52:48.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,别再想着去拿你藏在背后的那块废铁了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.20,1:52:53.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,扔了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.44,1:52:54.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.80,1:52:55.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.00,1:53:05.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也用不着这个了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.08,1:53:15.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.44,1:53:18.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼,我们得快走
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.72,1:53:32.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,电量只剩1%了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.24,1:53:33.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.96,1:54:07.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.04,1:54:19.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是要送我去海牙吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.36,1:54:22.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是海牙
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.84,1:54:33.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,没电了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.36,1:54:39.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.68,1:54:41.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,等等,再等等
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.32,1:54:42.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能等了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.72,1:54:53.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.64,1:54:56.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿,巴尼,快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.92,1:55:04.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,来不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.48,1:55:05.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,永别了,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.52,1:55:09.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼,巴尼
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.40,1:55:14.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.56,1:55:52.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,拉我上去
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.04,1:55:55.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你敢再解雇我们吗
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.68,1:55:56.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.40,1:55:58.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听不见
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.80,1:56:00.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要宰了你
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.40,1:56:07.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,行了,对不起,拉我上去,你们这帮笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.40,1:56:10.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让他上来
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.28,1:56:28.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,敬凯撒,凯撒
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.96,1:56:30.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯撒,凯撒,凯撒
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.88,1:56:33.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯撒
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.52,1:56:41.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 耶,嗨,巴尼  - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.92,1:56:43.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我不需要这个了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.24,1:56:45.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,把好运收回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.16,1:56:52.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,但愿没被我撑大
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.80,1:56:54.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经撑大了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.40,1:56:56.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.96,1:56:58.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许再这么吓唬我们了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.76,1:57:00.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 强壮凯撒  - 敬我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.56,1:57:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没把他送到海牙
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.92,1:57:15.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说,鼓手,跟你合作也不算糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.64,1:57:21.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好久没玩得这么开心了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.32,1:57:22.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,开心最重要
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.16,1:57:27.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些家伙都是神经病
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.56,1:57:28.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这个帅吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.64,1:57:31.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是"地球超人"装逼指南吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.68,1:57:33.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我很惹火  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.00,1:57:35.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,得了,如果你非要做救星者的话...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.36,1:57:36.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你外号"地球超人"是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.84,1:57:39.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,老派少校
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.16,1:57:40.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,坏蛋少校
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.52,1:57:42.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这小子
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.92,1:57:45.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.16,1:57:49.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我表现得这么好,说明我这个人真的很有价值
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.44,1:57:54.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有希望吗,既然我跟你一样疯狂
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.12,1:57:56.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我相信我适合这个团队
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.64,1:57:58.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 高格  - 是,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.48,1:58:05.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入敢死队
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.36,1:58:07.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.52,1:58:10.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我纹这个花了好大一笔钱,你懂我意思吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.00,1:58:12.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真是太高兴了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.72,1:58:15.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴尼,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.72,1:58:18.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不不,不要拥抱,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.16,1:58:19.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.72,1:58:21.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要拥抱
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.04,1:58:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,三局两胜
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.24,1:58:47.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.68,1:58:50.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢什么  - 谢谢你的关心
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.40,1:58:51.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,得了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.72,1:58:54.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.08,1:58:55.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你年轻30岁
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.24,1:58:56.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定会怕你的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.48,1:58:58.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.40,1:59:03.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,阴阳,你好像长高点儿了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.60,1:59:05.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,个子高的人活不长
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.76,1:59:08.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在为战壕工作了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.84,1:59:11.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有你,你不是退休了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.04,1:59:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我骗你的  - 行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.44,1:59:22.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们去开房间吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.80,1:59:27.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们哪儿需要开房
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.64,1:59:29.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真会吃醋
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.80,1:59:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是大家一起来的,走也要一起走
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.12,1:59:34.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 听见吗  - 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.52,1:59:36.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 干杯  - 干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.60,1:59:42.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,对一个不愿意听命令的人来说
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.96,1:59:44.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你表现得不错
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.80,1:59:45.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.64,1:59:48.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我几时能接班
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.28,1:59:50.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,喝你的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.76,1:59:52.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,斯麦利
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.56,1:59:54.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,到这儿来
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.64,1:59:57.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干得很好
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.00,2:00:20.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 老人家,看看我的生活 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.97,2:00:24.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 24岁,我的时间还有很多 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.80,2:00:27.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 独自在天堂生活 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.68,2:00:30.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 想找个伴儿一起过 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.60,2:00:34.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 爱情的代价太大 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.01,2:00:39.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,∮ 你就像个自豪的疯狂的老爸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.68,2:00:42.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以去掉疯狂这两个字
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.56,2:00:45.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是在夸你呢
